// Authored bilingual learning material. English is local content, not an online translator.
const EN_LESSON_ROWS = [
['start','Voltage, current and resistance','Voltage is an energy difference per unit charge between two points. Current is charge passing a point per second. Resistance relates the two for an approximately ohmic component.','With 5 V across 1 kΩ, I=5/1000=0.005 A=5 mA. Power is 5×0.005=0.025 W.','A voltage source can maintain voltage across an open circuit while current is zero. Never connect a current meter directly across a source.'],
['components','Resistors, capacitors, diodes and MOSFETs','Identify the symbol, terminals, polarity and ratings before wiring. A resistor dissipates energy; a capacitor stores electric-field energy; a diode is directional; a MOSFET controls a channel using gate voltage.','For a 5 V source and a 2 V LED at 8 mA, R=(5−2)/0.008=375 Ω. A 390 Ω part gives about 7.7 mA in this simplified model.','A MOSFET threshold voltage is not a promise of low on-resistance. Check the rated gate drive, power dissipation and safe operating area.'],
['rc','RC time constants and low-pass filtering','A capacitor voltage cannot jump without an impulse of current in the ideal model. The resistor limits charging current, so the voltage approaches its final value exponentially.','R=1 kΩ and C=10 μF give τ=RC=0.01 s. After one τ, charging reaches 63.2%; after five τ, about 99.3%.','The cutoff frequency is 1/(2πRC), about 15.9 Hz here. A loading circuit changes the effective resistance and therefore the result.'],
['meter','A multimeter measures between terminals','Select the quantity, jack and range before connecting probes. Voltage is measured in parallel; current requires opening the branch and inserting the meter in series.','Two 1 kΩ resistors in series across 5 V give 2.5 V at the midpoint relative to ground. Disconnect power before measuring resistance.','OL can mean overrange or an open path depending on mode. A current jack used across the source may blow the meter fuse.'],
['scope','Reading an oscilloscope','The horizontal scale converts screen distance into time. The vertical scale converts height into voltage. Triggering chooses a reproducible starting event.','A 1 kHz signal has a 1 ms period. At 0.2 ms/div, one period spans five divisions. A 4 Vpp signal spans four divisions at 1 V/div.','Match the physical probe ratio and channel setting. A conventional grounded scope clip is not an isolated differential input.'],
['logic','Logic levels, timing and decoding','A logic analyzer compares input voltage with a threshold, samples the resulting bits and interprets a protocol. A believable decoded byte does not prove electrical signal quality.','UART 8N1 sends one low start bit, eight data bits least significant first and one high stop bit. 0x41 is decimal 65.','Wrong baud rate, insufficient sample rate, threshold mismatch or a missing common reference can cause decoding errors.'],
['power','Power supplies and electronic loads','Set voltage and current limit before enabling output. Constant-voltage mode holds voltage while current depends on the load. In constant-current limiting, voltage falls as needed.','A 20 Ω resistor on 5 V requests 0.25 A. With a 0.1 A limit, a simple ideal supply delivers about 2 V and 0.1 A.','Current limiting is not a substitute for all protection. Check polarity, resistor wattage, cable limits and load power ratings.'],
['solder','Soldering is controlled heat transfer','The joint must receive enough heat for flux activation and wetting. Tip temperature, contact area, time, cleanliness and thermal mass all matter.','A large ground plane draws heat away faster than a small pad. A larger suitable tip can transfer heat better than simply increasing the set temperature.','Do not infer joint temperature from the station display alone. Use ventilation, eye protection and the process limits for the actual parts.'],
['mcu','From GPIO to DMA','A microcontroller combines a CPU, memory and peripherals. GPIO drives or senses pins; timers measure time; ADC converts voltage; DMA moves data without a CPU copy for each sample.','Begin with a blinking LED, then a button, then a timer interrupt, then periodic ADC sampling. Verify each stage before combining them.','Check the exact part, alternate pin functions, clock tree and voltage limits. Similar-looking board pins are not interchangeable.'],
['protocol','UART, I²C, SPI and CAN','Separate physical wiring, signal levels, timing and message format. UART is asynchronous; I²C uses addressed shared wires; SPI uses a clock and chip-select; CAN adds arbitration.','For an I²C write, observe START, address plus direction, ACK, data plus ACK and STOP. A missing address ACK should be investigated before sending more data.','A connector shape does not define a protocol. Check pull-ups, termination, reference ground and logic levels before software.'],
['vision','From grayscale pixels to a mask','A grayscale image is an array of intensities. Thresholding creates a binary mask by comparing each pixel with a chosen value. The histogram counts pixels at each intensity.','Raise a global threshold and fewer pixels usually remain foreground. Local thresholds can compensate for gradual illumination changes.','A clean-looking mask is not proof of reliable detection. Test background changes, glare, shadows and unseen objects.'],
['robot','Frames, joints and kinematic chains','A coordinate is meaningful only relative to a frame. Forward kinematics maps joint positions to the end point. Inverse kinematics asks which joints can reach a target.','For two 100 mm links, q1=0° and q2=90° give x=100 mm and y=100 mm. A target farther than 200 mm cannot be reached.','A mathematical solution may violate joint limits or cause collision. Kinematics alone does not certify a safe motion.'],
['project','Build a system one verified block at a time','Define the observable goal before choosing parts. Split a robot into power, sensing, computation, actuation and communication, with clear interfaces and failure responses.','First log one sensor, then drive one unloaded actuator, then close one feedback loop, then integrate on a restrained low-energy test rig.','Do not use a successful demo as the only acceptance test. Record conditions, failures, recovery behavior and repeatability.'],
['c-memory','C memory, pointers and registers','A variable has a type, value and storage lifetime. A pointer holds an address; dereferencing accesses the referenced object only when the address and lifetime are valid.','For uint8_t x=0xA5, x & 0x0F is 0x05. Use x | (1u<<3) to set bit 3 and x & ~(1u<<3) to clear it.','An out-of-bounds pointer or expired object is not made safe by a cast. Hardware registers may also have read or write side effects.'],
['boards','Choosing an MCU, SBC or AI board','Start from timing, interfaces, power and software needs. An MCU is often suited to deterministic peripheral control; an SBC offers an operating system; an AI board adds acceleration.','Write a table of sensor interfaces, control period, memory, power budget and required libraries before selecting a board.','Check the exact model and supported software release. Performance claims for one family member do not transfer to another.'],
['sensors','Sensors, filtering and estimation','A sensor measures a physical quantity through a transfer function. Calibration converts raw counts into units; filtering reduces selected variations; estimation combines measurements with a model.','Log a stationary sensor first. Estimate bias and noise, then test a known input at several values before adding a moving robot.','Filtering adds delay and cannot recover information that was never sampled. Do not confuse precision with accuracy.'],
['motor-control','Motors, drivers and feedback control','A motor converts electrical power into mechanical power. The driver handles power switching. A controller compares target and measured motion, then changes the driver command.','At 0.5 N·m and 300 rpm, P=τω=0.5×300×2π/60≈15.7 W. At 70% efficiency, input is about 22.4 W.','Startup and stall current can greatly exceed normal running current. Never power a motor directly from a logic GPIO.'],
['rtos','Tasks, queues and concurrency','An RTOS schedules tasks and provides synchronization. A queue transfers data; a mutex protects shared ownership; a semaphore signals events or available resources.','Let a sampling task publish measurements to a control task through a bounded queue. Define what happens when the consumer is slower.','Priority is not a cure for blocking code. Check stack size, deadlines, race conditions and priority inversion.'],
['pcb','From schematic to a verified PCB','The schematic expresses electrical intent; the PCB implements it with real geometry. Footprint pins, return paths, clearances, power distribution and assembly access must agree.','Before ordering, cross-check every connector and package pin with its datasheet. After assembly, inspect shorts and use a limited supply for first power-up.','A passing design-rule check only covers configured rules. It cannot confirm that the intended circuit is correct.'],
['ml','Machine learning and reinforcement learning','Supervised learning uses examples with targets. Reinforcement learning learns from actions and rewards. Both require a clear task and evaluation on conditions not used to fit the system.','In a grid world, Q-learning updates an action value toward reward plus discounted future value. Compare learning curves and the resulting path.','A high training reward can reflect a flawed reward definition. Report evaluation conditions, randomness and failure cases.'],
['linux-ros','Linux and ROS 2 integration','Processes communicate through explicit interfaces. In ROS 2, nodes publish or subscribe to typed topics, while services and actions support request or goal-oriented work.','First verify a timestamped sensor topic, then frame transforms, then a recorded replay, then a controller consuming the data.','Check distribution compatibility, time synchronization and QoS. A running process does not prove correct system behavior.'],
['kirchhoff','Closed loops, series and parallel circuits','An ideal node is a set of points connected by ideal wire. Kirchhoff current law balances current at a node; voltage law balances voltage changes around a loop.','Two 1 kΩ resistors in series have 2 kΩ total resistance. In parallel they have 500 Ω. Across 5 V they draw 2.5 mA and 10 mA respectively.','A schematic crossing is not automatically a connection. Identify junction dots and net labels before calculating.'],
['ac','AC, phase, RMS and impedance','An AC quantity changes over time. Phase describes relative timing. RMS relates a waveform to equivalent resistive heating. Impedance includes frequency-dependent magnitude and phase.','A sine wave with 2 V peak has 4 V peak-to-peak and about 1.414 V RMS when its DC offset is zero.','Peak/√2 applies to a sine wave, not every waveform. A DC offset changes total RMS.'],
['adc','ADC, DAC and sampling error','An ADC maps an input range into discrete codes. A DAC maps codes back to an analog output. Reference accuracy, input settling, quantization and sampling timing all affect results.','An ideal 12-bit ADC over 3.3 V has about 3.3/4096≈0.806 mV per step. The actual transfer convention comes from the datasheet.','Stay inside input limits, allow settling and filter frequencies above the useful band before sampling. Digital processing cannot undo aliasing.'],
['opamp','Op-amps, comparators and feedback','An op-amp amplifies a voltage difference. Negative feedback can establish a useful closed-loop behavior only within input, output, bandwidth and stability limits.','A non-inverting stage with Rf=10 kΩ and Rg=10 kΩ has ideal gain 1+Rf/Rg=2. Check whether the required output fits the supply rails.','An ideal equation is not a component specification. Check common-mode range, output swing, load and stability.'],
['protection','Grounding, decoupling and protection','Ground is a chosen reference and a real current-return network. Decoupling provides a local high-frequency current path. Protection addresses identified overcurrent, reverse-polarity or transient events.','Place local decoupling close to supply pins with a short return loop. Trace where motor current returns relative to sensitive measurements.','A ground symbol does not eliminate resistance or inductance. A fuse alone may not protect a fast semiconductor fault.'],
['c-flow','From C variables to state machines','Use types and units deliberately. Conditions choose behavior; loops repeat it; functions name reusable operations. A state machine makes permitted transitions explicit.','A button controller can have IDLE, DEBOUNCE and PRESSED states. Time-stamped transitions avoid blocking the entire program with delays.','Distinguish assignment from comparison and check integer range. Define what every unexpected input should do.'],
['cpp','C++ resources and interfaces','Objects can tie resource lifetime to scope. RAII acquires a resource during construction and releases it during destruction, while interfaces expose the operations a caller needs.','Use an owning container for a buffer and pass a bounded view to a function. The function should not guess the buffer length from a pointer.','Avoid unclear ownership and hidden dynamic allocation in time-critical paths. Language features do not replace timing measurements.'],
['python','Python for data and automation','Python scripts can parse measurements, compute statistics and automate repeatable checks. Use explicit units, data schemas and error handling so another person can rerun the workflow.','Read a CSV with timestamps and voltages, reject malformed rows, calculate mean and standard deviation, then save a plot with labeled axes.','Do not silently discard bad data or overwrite original measurements. Save the software version and processing parameters.'],
['cpu-arch','CPU execution, startup and disassembly','A CPU fetches an instruction, interprets it and updates registers or memory. Startup code prepares the execution environment before ordinary application logic begins.','Single-step a short loop: add a counter into a sum, decrement it, compare with zero and branch. The sum from 1 to 5 is 15.','This teaching ISA is not ARM, RISC-V or x86 machine code. Real startup, interrupts and memory maps are architecture-specific.'],
['51','Learning peripherals with an 8051-family MCU','Begin with the exact derivative and oscillator configuration. Learn ports, timers, interrupts and serial communication as separate experiments before combining them.','Measure a timer-generated output period instead of trusting a delay loop. Compare the measurement with the configured clock and divider.','8051-compatible chips differ in timing, memory and peripherals. Use the specific datasheet rather than a generic pin diagram.'],
['arduino','From Arduino compilation to hardware checks','The board selection controls toolchain and target settings. The sketch is compiled and uploaded through a bootloader or programmer, then runs under the selected core.','Blink an onboard LED, confirm the actual pin, read a button with a defined pull resistor, then add a sensor with a matching library.','A successful upload does not prove wiring or voltage compatibility. Record board package and library versions.'],
['esp-net','Networking, sleep and OTA on ESP32','Wireless networking adds reconnects, variable latency and power peaks. Sleep modes preserve different amounts of state. OTA requires image validation and a recovery strategy.','Test lost Wi-Fi, failed credentials, interrupted downloads and a bad new image before treating OTA as reliable.','Check the exact SoC and SDK version. Keep credentials out of source and distinguish network availability from application health.'],
['bus-physical','Differential buses and termination','Differential signaling interprets a voltage difference between conductors. Cable impedance, topology, termination, common-mode range and isolation affect communication.','For a bus intended to be terminated at both ends, inspect end placement rather than adding a resistor at every node.','RS-485 describes a physical interface, not one universal message protocol. CAN and Ethernet also require their own physical and protocol checks.'],
['rc-link','Remote-control links and ESC commands','A control channel carries commands with a defined encoding, update rate and failsafe behavior. Link loss must lead to a deliberate safe state.','Log incoming command age. Reject stale commands and test loss of signal on a restrained low-energy setup before powering a vehicle.','Do not assume every servo, receiver or ESC accepts the same pulse timing or digital protocol. Check arming and range rules.'],
['vision-ops','Filtering, contours and camera calibration','Filtering modifies spatial variation; morphology modifies masks; contours describe boundaries; calibration relates image coordinates to camera geometry.','Compare a raw mask with an opened and closed mask, then measure how object area changes. Use a calibration target across varied views.','Pixel coordinates alone are not millimeters. Lens distortion, camera pose and depth affect geometric interpretation.'],
['estimation','State estimation and uncertainty','A state estimate combines predictions with noisy observations. Uncertainty describes how much confidence to place in each source, not just the current best value.','For a scalar Kalman update, K=P/(P+R). Larger measurement noise R reduces the weight placed on that measurement.','Incorrect noise assumptions or model bias can make a smooth-looking estimate wrong. Check residuals against independent evidence.'],
['foc','Field-oriented motor control','FOC expresses measured motor currents in a rotating coordinate frame so torque-producing and flux-related components can be controlled. Current sampling and rotor angle must be synchronized.','Trace phase-current measurements through Clarke and Park transforms, current controllers, inverse transforms and PWM generation before tuning gains.','This topic requires motor physics, feedback and real-time sampling. Incorrect angle or current polarity can cause dangerous torque.'],
['bio','Biosignals and human-interface boundaries','Biosignals are small, noisy and sensitive to acquisition conditions. Human-connected hardware requires isolation, appropriate standards and qualified review beyond a classroom signal model.','Use prerecorded or synthetic data to study filtering, features and classification before considering any human-connected experiment.','A waveform classifier is not a medical diagnosis. Do not connect ordinary grounded instruments or unreviewed circuits to a person.'],
['research','Designing a reproducible engineering experiment','State the hypothesis, independent variable, measured outcome and acceptance criterion. Preserve raw data, document equipment and separate observation from interpretation.','Change one parameter at a time, repeat measurements, record uncertainty and compare with a baseline under the same conditions.','Do not select only successful trials. Report exclusions, failed runs and the limits of what the experiment supports.'],
['analog-guide','Meters can change the circuit they measure','A voltmeter has finite input resistance and draws current. An ammeter adds series resistance. Loading error depends on the meter relative to the circuit.','For two 1 MΩ divider resistors, a 1 MΩ voltmeter across the lower resistor changes it to 0.5 MΩ and the midpoint from V/2 to V/3.','Choosing a range can change instrument loading. Compare the expected circuit impedance with the meter specification.'],
['hotair-guide','Hot air: set temperature versus part temperature','Airflow, nozzle size, distance, board mass and heating time determine heat transfer. The displayed setpoint is not a direct measurement of a component body.','Use a sacrificial board and suitable temperature measurement to compare heating with different distances and airflow. Protect nearby parts.','Excess airflow can move small components; uneven heating can damage pads. Follow part and board process limits.'],
['stencil-guide','Stencil printing and solder-paste defects','A stencil controls paste volume through aperture geometry and thickness. Alignment, paste condition, support and separation affect the deposited shape.','Inspect whether each deposit aligns with its pad before placement. Compare insufficient paste, excessive paste and bridges on a teaching pattern.','Aperture dimensions cannot be chosen from pad size alone. Check the assembly process and package guidance.'],
['reflow-guide','Reading a reflow temperature profile','A profile includes heating, stabilization, time above liquidus and cooling. The actual board temperature must be measured, not inferred solely from heater settings.','Compare a measured thermocouple trace with the paste and component process limits. Record peak temperature and time above liquidus.','There is no universal safe curve for every paste, board and component. Repeated heating can damage materials.'],
['wiring-guide','From a schematic to physical connections','Translate each schematic node into a physical connection. Identify supply, return, polarity and component terminals with power disconnected.','Build source→resistor→LED anode→LED cathode→return. Verify continuity and the resistor value, then enable a limited low-voltage supply.','Breadboard strips are internally connected in groups. Do not assume adjacent holes are connected or that a power rail is uninterrupted.']
];
const EN_LESSONS=Object.fromEntries(EN_LESSON_ROWS.map(([id,title,idea,example,error])=>[id,{title,idea,example,error}]));
const DEEP_LESSONS={
 start:[
 ['先认识一条完整回路','Start with a complete loop','先不碰真实电路。把画面中的电源想成提供能量的装置，电阻是消耗能量的元件，导线把它们连接成一圈。沿着电源正端走，经过元件，最终必须能回到负端。先找到这个闭合路径，再讨论电流大小。','Use the simulation first. The source supplies energy, the resistor dissipates it and the wires form a return path. Trace from the positive terminal through the components back to the negative terminal before calculating current.'],
 ['三个量，不是三个名字而已','Three different physical quantities','电压描述两个点之间每单位电荷的能量差，必须说“哪两点之间”。电流描述每秒通过一个截面的电荷量，必须说“哪条支路”。电阻描述元件对电流的约束。把电压称为“流过元件的电压”会混淆测量对象。','Voltage is energy difference per charge between two points. Current is charge passing a cross-section each second. Resistance constrains current. Say voltage across a component and current through a branch.'],
 ['把单位变成能计算的数','Convert units before calculating','1 kΩ=1000 Ω；1 mA=0.001 A。5 V÷1 kΩ可先写成5÷1000=0.005 A，再乘1000得到5 mA。不要把5÷1得到的5误写成5 A。每行都保留单位，有助于发现数量级错误。','1 kΩ=1000 Ω and 1 mA=0.001 A. Calculate 5/1000=0.005 A, then convert to 5 mA. Keep units on every line to catch a thousand-fold error.'],
 ['LED为什么要减去2 V','Why subtract the LED voltage?','本实验把LED近似成导通时压降2 V的元件。5 V电源并不是全部加在电阻上：LED占用2 V，电阻分到3 V。因此330 Ω时I=3÷330≈9.09 mA。真实LED压降随电流、温度和型号变化，2 V只是这里的模型。','The model assumes a 2 V LED drop while conducting. With a 5 V source, the resistor receives 3 V, so 330 Ω gives 3/330≈9.09 mA. A real LED drop depends on current, temperature and type.'],
 ['先预测，再操作','Predict, then change one thing','保持330 Ω，把电压从5 V调到8 V。先计算电阻两端从3 V变为6 V，因此电流应加倍。再观察读数和光点。随后断开回路：电源还有电压，但电流为零。这两次对比比记住一个公式更重要。','Keep 330 Ω and raise the source from 5 V to 8 V. The resistor voltage doubles from 3 V to 6 V, so predict twice the current. Then open the loop: source voltage remains but current becomes zero.'],
 ['电流正常，还要检查发热','Check power as well as current','在5 V、330 Ω的LED模型中，电阻功率P=I²R≈0.027 W。如果换成更高电压或更小电阻，功率可能明显增加。真实选型要把额定功率、温升和降额一起核对，不能只看“能不能亮”。','For the 5 V, 330 Ω LED model, resistor power is about 0.027 W. Higher voltage or lower resistance can raise dissipation sharply. Check the actual power rating, temperature and derating, not only whether the LED lights.']
 ],
 meter:[
 ['功能、量程、插孔是三次选择','Function, range and jack are separate choices','功能决定测什么：V⎓测直流电压，A⎓测直流电流，Ω测电阻，蜂鸣符号判定低阻通路。量程决定该功能下可显示的范围与分辨率；插孔决定内部连接。三者必须一起正确，不能只转动旋钮就忽略表笔插孔。','Function chooses the quantity: V⎓ for DC voltage, A⎓ for DC current, Ω for resistance and a beeper for low-resistance continuity. Range sets display capacity/resolution within a function; the jack sets the internal connection. All three must agree.'],
 ['量程怎样选，为什么会超量程','Choosing a range and understanding overrange','已知约5V的直流信号，2V量程容纳不下，20V量程可以显示。未知但确认在仪表额定允许范围内时，手动表先从合适高量程开始，再降到不超量程的档位。更小量程常有更细分辨率，但量程、允许输入极限和安全类别是不同概念。','For a known signal near 5 V DC, a 2 V range is too small while 20 V can display it. For an unknown signal already verified within the meter’s ratings, start at a suitable high manual range and reduce without overrange. Finer range resolution is distinct from maximum input and safety category.'],
 ['先看插孔，再看屏幕','Check the jack before the display','黑表笔通常接COM。测电压和电阻时红表笔接VΩ；测小电流时才按仪表说明换到mA插孔。插孔决定电流在仪表内部经过什么路径，因此不是随便选一个能插进去的位置。','The black lead normally goes to COM. The red lead goes to VΩ for voltage or resistance and to the specified current jack for current. The jack selects a real internal circuit path.'],
 ['测电压：比较两个节点','Voltage compares two nodes','把表笔看成一对问题：红笔所在点比黑笔所在点高多少伏？并联测量不需要剪开原回路。交换红黑笔时，大小相同而符号反向。负号不等于故障，它可能只是参考方向相反。','The reading asks how much higher the red-probe node is than the black-probe node. Connect in parallel without breaking the circuit. Reversing probes reverses the sign, not necessarily the validity of the measurement.'],
 ['测电流：让支路经过仪表','Current must pass through the meter','先断电，打开要测的支路，把仪表串进去，再确认档位和插孔后上电。电流档内阻很小，并接电源相当于提供一条低阻短路路径。不要通过真实短路来“验证”这个结论。','Switch off, open the branch, insert the current meter in series, verify the jack and range, then energize. A current input has low resistance; connecting it across a supply creates a short-circuit path.'],
 ['测电阻：被测电路必须无源','Resistance measurement needs an unpowered circuit','电阻档由仪表施加小测试信号，再推算电阻。外部电压会干扰甚至损坏仪表。断电后还要确认储能已经释放；并联支路也会让读数不是某一只电阻的标称值。','The meter applies its own small test signal. External voltage invalidates the measurement and may damage the meter. Remove power, verify stored energy is discharged, and consider parallel paths.'],
 ['按顺序排查OL','Investigate OL in context','如果测电压时出现OL，先检查量程；如果测电阻时出现OL，可能是开路或阻值超量程。先确认档位，再确认插孔，然后量程、接触点、供电状态。不要只因看到OL就认为元件坏了。','For voltage, OL often indicates overrange; for resistance it may indicate an open path or excessive resistance. Check mode, jack, range, contact and power state in that order.']
 ],
 scope:[
 ['一张图同时表达两种量','One plot has two physical axes','横轴是时间，纵轴是电压。每大格代表多少秒和多少伏，由时基和垂直档位决定。屏幕上“很高”的波形可能只是把垂直刻度放大，并不是电路真的输出了更高电压。','The horizontal axis is time and the vertical axis is voltage. Seconds per division and volts per division convert screen distances into physical values. A taller trace may simply reflect a changed scale.'],
 ['周期和频率互相换算','Period and frequency are reciprocals','从一个波峰到下一个波峰是一个周期T。频率f=1/T。若一周期占5格，每格0.2 ms，那么T=1 ms=0.001 s，f=1000 Hz。先把毫秒换成秒再取倒数。','One cycle spans corresponding points such as consecutive peaks. At five divisions and 0.2 ms/div, T=1 ms=0.001 s, so f=1/T=1000 Hz.'],
 ['峰值与峰峰值不要混淆','Peak and peak-to-peak are different','没有直流偏置的正弦波若从−2 V到+2 V，峰值是2 V，峰峰值是4 V。只有在正弦等特定条件下，才能用峰值除以√2得到有效值。方波、脉冲和带偏置波形需要另算。','A zero-offset sine from −2 V to +2 V has 2 V peak and 4 V peak-to-peak. Peak divided by √2 gives RMS for a sine wave under the stated conditions, not for every waveform.'],
 ['触发是在选一个稳定起点','Triggering selects a repeatable start','让每帧在信号向上穿过0 V时开始，波形就能稳定重叠。如果触发电平高于信号最大值，就等不到这个事件。触发不改变被测信号，只改变采集开始的时机。','Starting each capture at an upward 0 V crossing aligns repeated frames. A trigger above the signal maximum cannot occur. Triggering changes capture timing, not the source signal.'],
 ['探头也属于测量系统','The probe is part of the measurement','物理探头设为10×时，通道设置也要对应10×；不匹配会造成读数比例错误。接地夹的连接需要结合仪器接地结构判断。真实台式示波器的地夹通常与保护地相连，不能随意夹到高侧节点。','Match a physical 10× probe with a 10× channel setting. Mismatch gives a scale error. A conventional bench-scope ground clip is usually earth-referenced and must not be attached arbitrarily to a high-side node.']
 ],
 'motor-control':[
 ['先分清电机、驱动器和控制器','Separate motor, driver and controller','电机负责把电能转换成机械运动；驱动器负责把电源能量按指令送到电机；控制器负责决定发什么指令。MCU输出的GPIO只是逻辑信号，通常不能直接给电机提供启动所需的电流。','The motor converts electrical energy into motion. The driver switches power. The controller decides the command. A microcontroller GPIO is a logic signal and normally cannot supply motor starting current.'],
 ['转速、转矩和功率分别是什么','Speed, torque and power','转速说的是转得多快；转矩说的是转动作用有多强。功率P=τω，其中ω使用rad/s。300 rpm要乘2π再除60，得到约31.42 rad/s。若转矩0.5 N·m，功率约15.7 W。不要把rpm直接代进公式。','Speed measures how fast rotation occurs; torque measures rotational effort. P=τω requires angular speed in rad/s. Convert 300 rpm to 31.42 rad/s, then multiply by 0.5 N·m to get about 15.7 W.'],
 ['PWM改变的是开通比例','PWM changes on-time fraction','PWM在高低电平间切换，占空比是一个周期内高电平所占比例。理想5 V信号占空比20%时平均电压1 V，80%时平均4 V。电机实际电流还受电感、反电动势、驱动方式和负载影响，转速不保证严格成正比。','Duty cycle is the fraction of a period spent high. An ideal 5 V signal averages 1 V at 20% and 4 V at 80%. Actual motor current also depends on inductance, back EMF, driver behavior and load.'],
 ['开环为什么会遇到问题','Why open-loop control can miss the target','同样的PWM指令，空载时可能转得快，负载增加后就变慢。电池电压降低也会改变结果。开环没有测量实际速度，只按预先设定的指令工作，因此无法知道自己有没有达到目标。','The same PWM command can produce different speeds as load or battery voltage changes. Open-loop control does not measure the achieved speed, so it cannot know whether the target was reached.'],
 ['闭环先计算误差','A feedback loop starts with error','编码器测得实际速度y，目标速度是r，误差e=r−y。比例项Kp·e会在误差大时给更强动作。只有比例控制时，为了维持某个输出，往往需要保留非零误差，所以可能出现稳态偏差。','An encoder measures actual speed y. With target r, error is e=r−y. The proportional term Kp·e responds more strongly to larger error. Proportional-only control often needs nonzero steady error to sustain output.'],
 ['积分不是神奇加速键','Integral action accumulates error','积分项把过去一段时间的误差累加。即使每一刻误差不大，持续存在的误差也会推动输出继续变化。在实验里把Ki设为0观察偏差，再恢复为1比较。积分过大、输出饱和或测量方向错误都可能使结果变差。','Integral action accumulates error over time. A persistent small error keeps changing the output. Compare Ki=0 with Ki=1. Excessive integration, actuator saturation or incorrect feedback polarity can worsen the response.'],
 ['扰动实验如何判断恢复','How to evaluate disturbance recovery','先让实际值接近目标，再施加额外负载。记录最低值、恢复时间和最终误差。不要只看曲线最后有没有回去，还要看中途是否超过允许范围。比较时保持目标、对象模型和扰动大小一致。','Let the response settle, then apply load. Record the largest deviation, recovery time and final error. A recovered final value does not excuse an unsafe transient. Keep target, plant and disturbance identical between comparisons.'],
 ['真实电机验证的顺序','A careful real-hardware test sequence','先核对电压、电流、驱动器和编码器规格；低压限流且固定机构，确认正方向；再读速度并验证单位；然后以较小目标测试比例控制，最后逐步加入积分。堵转测试、强力机构和FOC实验不能直接照搬课堂动画。','Verify motor, driver and encoder ratings. Restrain the mechanism and use a limited supply to check direction. Verify measured speed and units, begin with small targets and proportional control, then introduce integral action. The animation is not a procedure for high-energy stall or FOC tests.']
 ],
 rc:[
 ['电容储存什么','What a capacitor stores','电容两端的导体隔着绝缘介质，可以储存电场能量。电容量C表示每增加一伏电压需要积累多少电荷。它不是一个无限容量的小电池，也不能在任意电压下工作。','Conductors separated by a dielectric store electric-field energy. Capacitance relates charge change to voltage change. A capacitor is not an unlimited small battery and has a voltage rating.'],
 ['为什么一开始快，后来慢','Why charging slows down','刚开始电容电压低，电源与电容的电压差大，电阻中的电流大。电容电压上升后，剩余电压差变小，电流随之减小，所以曲线逐渐变平。','Initially the capacitor voltage is low, so the voltage across the resistor and the charging current are high. As capacitor voltage rises, the difference shrinks, reducing current and flattening the curve.'],
 ['手算时间常数','Calculate a time constant','本动画默认10 kΩ和100 μF。10 kΩ=10000 Ω，100 μF=0.0001 F，因此τ=1 s。在1 s时应接近3.16 V，在5 s时接近4.97 V。先预测，再暂停读取。','The animation starts at 10 kΩ and 100 μF. Convert to 10000 Ω and 0.0001 F, giving τ=1 s. Charging from zero toward 5 V gives about 3.16 V at 1 s and 4.97 V at 5 s.'],
 ['切换放电，起点会被保留','Discharge starts from the current voltage','切换放电时，电容不会立即清零，而是从当时的电压继续按指数下降。如果只充到3 V就开始放电，一秒后的值是3/e≈1.10 V，而不是从5 V开始算。','Switching to discharge preserves the current capacitor voltage. If charging reached only 3 V, after one time constant of discharge the voltage is 3/e≈1.10 V, not 5/e.']
 ]
};
// Paired examples share the same circuit, assumptions and units in both languages.
const WORKED_EXAMPLES7=Object.fromEntries([
 ['start','5V电源、近似2V压降LED与330Ω串联：电阻电压=5−2=3V，I=3/330=0.00909A=9.09mA，电阻功耗P=3×0.00909≈0.0273W。真实LED压降随电流和温度变化。','A 5 V source drives a modeled 2 V LED and 330 Ω in series. The resistor has 3 V, so I=3/330=0.00909 A=9.09 mA and its power is about 0.0273 W. Real LED drop varies with current and temperature.'],
 ['kirchhoff','两个1kΩ串联接5V：R总=2kΩ，I=2.5mA，中点对地2.5V。若再给下臂并接1kΩ负载，下臂成为500Ω，输出为5×500/(1000+500)≈1.667V。','Two 1 kΩ series resistors across 5 V give 2 kΩ, 2.5 mA and a 2.5 V midpoint. Adding a 1 kΩ load across the lower arm makes it 500 Ω, so output becomes 5×500/(1000+500)≈1.667 V.'],
 ['components','仅有100Ω电阻直接接5V时，I=5/100=0.05A，P=5×0.05=0.25W。这不同于带LED的串联电路；选择实际电阻还要留出符合温度与厂家降额要求的余量。','A 100 Ω resistor directly across 5 V draws 0.05 A and dissipates 0.25 W. This differs from a series LED circuit. Select the actual rating with margin appropriate to temperature and manufacturer derating.'],
 ['wiring-guide','把5V正端接330Ω，再接LED阳极，LED阴极接回流端。闭合且正向时，按2V LED模型得I=(5−2)/330≈9.09mA；断路时稳态支路电流为0。','Connect 5 V positive to 330 Ω, then LED anode, with cathode to return. Closed and forward biased, the 2 V LED model gives I=(5−2)/330≈9.09 mA. An open branch carries zero steady current.'],
 ['meter','5V、2V LED、330Ω串联时，先用直流电压档和VΩ/COM测电源5V、LED约2V、电阻约3V。红黑表笔交换后电阻读数约−3V。量电流必须改为串联，不能把电流插孔跨接电源。','For a 5 V source, 2 V LED and 330 Ω, DC voltage mode with VΩ/COM reads 5 V at the source, about 2 V at the LED and 3 V at the resistor. Reversing probes gives about −3 V. Current measurement requires series insertion, never a current input across the source.'],
 ['power','5V设定驱动2V LED与330Ω，本来需9.09mA。把限流降到5mA，电阻压降变成0.005×330=1.65V，输出约2+1.65=3.65V，进入CC；20mA限流时仍只取约9.09mA。','At a 5 V setting, a 2 V LED and 330 Ω need 9.09 mA. A 5 mA limit gives 1.65 V across the resistor and about 3.65 V output in CC. A 20 mA limit still permits only the approximately 9.09 mA demanded by this load.'],
 ['rc','10kΩ=10000Ω，100μF=0.0001F，故τ=RC=1s。从0V向5V充电，1s后为5(1−e⁻¹)≈3.16V，5s后≈4.97V。轻载电容输出低通的fc=1/(2πτ)≈0.159Hz。','10 kΩ is 10000 Ω and 100 μF is 0.0001 F, giving τ=1 s. Charging from 0 V toward 5 V gives about 3.16 V after 1 s and 4.97 V after 5 s. The lightly loaded capacitor-output low-pass has fc=1/(2πτ)≈0.159 Hz.'],
 ['scope','教学正弦设1Hz、幅值2V：周期T=1s，峰峰值4V。0.2s/div时一周期占5格；1V/div时峰峰跨4格。工程例中1kHz对应1ms，换算规律相同，但不能把两种单位混在同一读数中。','A teaching sine at 1 Hz and 2 V amplitude has T=1 s and 4 Vpp. At 0.2 s/div it spans five divisions per period; at 1 V/div it spans four divisions peak-to-peak. A separate 1 kHz engineering example has a 1 ms period; keep the units distinct.'],
 ['logic','0x41=65，二进制写作01000001。UART 8N1先发起始0，再按D0到D7发1、0、0、0、0、0、1、0，最后停止1，共10位。9600baud、连续无间隔时每帧10/9600≈1.042ms。','0x41=65 is written 01000001 in binary. UART 8N1 sends start 0, data D0…D7 as 1,0,0,0,0,0,1,0, then stop 1: ten bits. At 9600 baud a continuous frame takes 10/9600≈1.042 ms.'],
 ['mcu','假设定时器已配置为每秒产生1000次更新事件，则周期为1/1000s=1ms。CPU负责配置、处理完成或错误；DMA可把每次ADC结果搬入缓冲区，但不会自动完成单位换算和结果解释。','Assume a timer is configured for 1000 update events per second. Its period is 1 ms. The CPU configures the system and handles completion/errors; DMA can copy each ADC result into a buffer but does not automatically convert units or interpret measurements.'],
 ['motor-control','转速300rpm换成角速度为300×2π/60≈31.416rad/s。0.5N·m轴转矩对应机械功率约15.71W；若该工作点效率70%，电气输入约22.44W。启动与堵转电流仍须单独核对。','300 rpm is 300×2π/60≈31.416 rad/s. At 0.5 N·m the shaft produces about 15.71 W. If efficiency at that operating point is 70%, electrical input is about 22.44 W. Startup and stall current require separate checks.'],
 ['robot','水平平面两杆各110mm，q1=0°、q2=90°时：x=110cos0°+110cos90°=110mm，y=110sin0°+110sin90°=110mm。最大几何距离220mm；关节角为相对前一级连杆的转角。','With two horizontal planar 110 mm links, q1=0° and q2=90° give x=110cos0°+110cos90°=110 mm and y=110sin0°+110sin90°=110 mm. Maximum geometric reach is 220 mm; each joint angle is relative to the preceding link/frame.'],
 ['solder','教学一阶热模型取工件初温25°C、最终热源350°C。经历一个时间常数后，工件温度为350+(25−350)e⁻¹≈230.44°C。这只说明热惯性，不能据此确定实际焊料是否充分润湿。','In an illustrative first-order model, a workpiece starts at 25°C with a 350°C final heat source. After one time constant, T=350+(25−350)e⁻¹≈230.44°C. This illustrates thermal lag, not proof of adequate solder wetting.'],
 ['protocol','UART 8N1每个数据字节占10个线路位。9600baud下每帧约1.042ms，连续无额外间隔最多960数据字节/秒；应用头、校验、重试与空闲会进一步降低有效载荷速率。','UART 8N1 uses ten line bits per data byte. At 9600 baud, a frame takes about 1.042 ms and continuous traffic carries at most 960 data bytes/s. Application headers, checks, retries and idle gaps reduce payload throughput.'],
 ['vision','对灰度[40,120,200]使用规则“像素值>阈值则为1，否则0”。阈值100得到[0,1,1]；阈值150得到[0,0,1]。前景数减少，但这本身没有说明哪个像素属于目标物体。','For grayscale [40,120,200], use value>threshold →1, otherwise 0. Threshold 100 produces [0,1,1]; threshold 150 produces [0,0,1]. Fewer foreground pixels do not establish which pixels belong to a target object.'],
 ['project','假设左右轮线速度均0.2m/s，理想差速车中心速度为0.2m/s，角速度0。若左轮−0.2、右轮0.2m/s、轮距0.35m，则中心速度0，角速度(0.2−(−0.2))/0.35≈1.143rad/s。','Assume both wheel speeds are 0.2 m/s. An ideal differential rover has center speed 0.2 m/s and zero yaw rate. With left −0.2, right 0.2 m/s and track 0.35 m, center speed is zero and yaw rate is about 1.143 rad/s.'],
 ['c-memory','uint8_t x=0xA5的位模式是10100101；与0x0F的00001111按位与，得00000101=5。结果只保留低4位。真实寄存器若含写1清零位，不能不查语义就套用普通读改写。','uint8_t x=0xA5 has pattern 10100101. AND with 0x0F (00001111) gives 00000101=5, retaining the low four bits. Registers with write-one-to-clear fields need their documented semantics rather than an automatic ordinary read-modify-write.'],
 ['boards','320×240、RGB565每像素2字节，一帧320×240×2=153600字节=150KiB，双缓冲300KiB。还要另计代码、栈、模型和中间张量；不能用标称总内存直接减去图片就宣称一定可运行。','A 320×240 RGB565 frame uses 320×240×2=153600 bytes=150 KiB; double buffering uses 300 KiB. Add code, stacks, models and intermediate tensors separately. Nominal total memory alone does not establish that the complete workload fits.'],
 ['sensors','标定点“物理量0→原始100、物理量10→原始1100”给出y=(raw−100)×0.01，raw=600得到5。100Hz数据采用5点因果移动平均，其通带群延迟为(5−1)/2×10ms=20ms。','Calibration points physical 0→raw 100 and physical 10→raw 1100 give y=(raw−100)×0.01, so raw 600 gives 5. A causal five-point moving average at 100 Hz has passband group delay (5−1)/2×10 ms=20 ms.'],
 ['rtos','生产者200条/秒、消费者100条/秒，积压以100条/秒增长。容量100且初始为空的队列约1秒后填满；确切溢出时刻取决于任务相位。增加缓存不能解决持续的速率差。','Production at 200 items/s and consumption at 100 items/s grow backlog by 100 items/s. An initially empty capacity-100 queue fills in about one second; exact overflow timing depends on task phase. More buffering cannot solve a persistent rate mismatch.'],
 ['pcb','课堂几何规则若规定线宽和间距都至少0.2mm，线宽0.18mm、间距0.25mm时仅线宽失败；把线宽改0.22mm后两项通过。这并不能证明载流能力、阻抗或原理图功能正确。','If classroom geometry requires both width and spacing of at least 0.2 mm, width 0.18 mm and spacing 0.25 mm fail width alone. Changing width to 0.22 mm passes both. This does not establish current capacity, impedance or functional correctness.'],
 ['ml','Q旧=0、α=0.2、奖励r=1、γ=0.9、下一状态最大Q=2，更新为0+0.2×(1+0.9×2−0)=0.56。若确实到达终止状态，未来项为0，结果改为0.2；截断与终止需按任务定义区分。','With old Q=0, α=0.2, reward 1, γ=0.9 and next-state max Q=2, the update is 0+0.2×(1+0.9×2−0)=0.56. For a truly terminal state the future term is zero, giving 0.2. Distinguish termination from time-limit truncation according to the task.'],
 ['linux-ros','在一个明确采用同一时钟的教学系统中，最后有效命令时间为2.00s，当前2.16s，命令年龄为160ms。若预先规定超时100ms，应进入定义的停止状态；ROS话题仍存在不等于命令仍有效。','In a teaching system with one defined clock, last valid command at 2.00 s and now 2.16 s gives age 160 ms. If timeout is specified as 100 ms, enter the defined stop state. An existing ROS topic does not make an old command valid.'],
 ['ac','4Vpp、零直流偏置正弦的峰值2V，RMS=2/√2≈1.414V。叠加2V直流偏置后总RMS=√(2²+1.414²)≈2.449V；峰峰值仍4V。','A 4 Vpp zero-offset sine has 2 V peak and RMS=2/√2≈1.414 V. Adding 2 V DC gives total RMS=√(2²+1.414²)≈2.449 V while peak-to-peak remains 4 V.'],
 ['adc','理想12位、3.3V量程有4096个码，名义步长3.3/4096≈0.806mV，码值范围0–4095。10kSa/s采样8kHz正弦会折叠为2kHz；增加位数不会解除这个混叠。','An ideal 12-bit 3.3 V range has 4096 codes with nominal step 3.3/4096≈0.806 mV and codes 0–4095. Sampling an 8 kHz sine at 10 kSa/s aliases to 2 kHz; more bits do not remove aliasing.'],
 ['opamp','同相运放Rf=90kΩ、Rg=10kΩ，理想闭环增益1+90/10=10，输入0.2V要求输出2V。只有输入共模、输出摆幅、负载和频率都处于允许范围，才能采用这个线性结果。','A non-inverting op-amp with Rf=90 kΩ and Rg=10 kΩ has ideal gain 10, requesting 2 V output for 0.2 V input. This linear result requires permitted input common mode, output swing, load and frequency.'],
 ['protection','LDO从12V降到3.3V、输出0.2A，忽略静态电流时损耗(12−3.3)×0.2=1.74W。允许温升还需要结合封装、板材和散热热阻计算，不能只看输出电流未超额。','An LDO dropping 12 V to 3.3 V at 0.2 A dissipates (12−3.3)×0.2=1.74 W, ignoring quiescent current. Temperature rise depends on package, board and thermal resistance; remaining below the current rating alone is insufficient.'],
 ['c-flow','假定实现提供uint8_t，把整数260转换为该无符号8位类型，结果按模256得到4。这是最终无符号转换规则；不要把它误认为所有带符号整数溢出都具有同样行为。','If uint8_t is provided, converting integer 260 to that unsigned eight-bit type gives 4 modulo 256. This is the final unsigned conversion rule; signed overflow does not universally behave the same way.'],
 ['cpp','一个对象独占文件句柄，离开作用域时析构关闭文件。把该对象移交给新拥有者后，旧对象不再负责同一句柄。若两个对象都以为自己独占，可能重复释放；RAII必须配合正确的复制/移动语义。','An owning object closes a file handle on destruction. After ownership transfers, the old object no longer owns that handle. If two objects both believe they own it, double release can follow. RAII requires appropriate copy and move semantics.'],
 ['python','CSV中三条有效电压为1V、2V、3V，均值为2V。若第四行写3000mV，要先按字段规则换成3V，或明确拒绝单位不一致，不能当作3000V一起平均。','Three valid CSV readings of 1 V, 2 V and 3 V average 2 V. If another row says 3000 mV, convert to 3 V under the schema or explicitly reject inconsistent units; do not average it as 3000 V.'],
 ['cpu-arch','累加程序先令sum=0、counter=5，每轮sum加counter，counter减1，再判断是否继续。五次累加为5+4+3+2+1=15；课堂PC是指令序号，不是实际字节地址。','Initialize sum=0 and counter=5, add counter to sum, decrement counter and test whether to repeat. Five additions give 5+4+3+2+1=15. The teaching PC is an instruction index, not a real byte address.'],
 ['51','假设某16位向上计数定时器每1μs增加1，1ms需1000次计数，预装值为65536−1000=64536。此式未补偿中断和重装延迟；具体1T/12T芯片与时钟分频必须另查。','Assume a 16-bit up-counter ticks every 1 μs. A 1 ms interval requires 1000 counts and preload 65536−1000=64536. This omits interrupt/reload delay; verify the actual 1T/12T derivative and clock divisor.'],
 ['arduino','假设输出高电平3.3V、LED压降2V、目标电流5mA，R=(3.3−2)/0.005=260Ω；选270Ω约4.81mA。还需核对该板GPIO电流、实际输出电压与引脚能力。','Assume 3.3 V output high, 2 V LED drop and 5 mA target: R=(3.3−2)/0.005=260 Ω. A 270 Ω resistor gives about 4.81 mA. Check the actual board GPIO current, output voltage and pin capability.'],
 ['esp-net','应用期望10字节消息，TCP先交付3字节、再交付7字节也完全可能。接收端应累计并依长度字段或明确分隔规则解析；一次读取不足10字节不代表消息已经损坏。','For an application message of ten bytes, TCP may deliver three bytes then seven. Accumulate data and parse using a length field or explicit delimiter rule. A short read does not by itself mean the message is corrupt.'],
 ['bus-physical','理想总线两端各120Ω终端，在断电且没有其他并联通路时，两线间等效电阻120∥120=60Ω。偏置、器件输入或其他通路会改变读数；60Ω也不能单独证明动态波形正确。','Two ideal 120 Ω end terminators measure 120∥120=60 Ω across an unpowered bus only without other parallel paths. Biasing, device inputs or other paths alter the reading. A 60 Ω reading alone does not prove correct dynamic waveforms.'],
 ['rc-link','一个假设脉冲每20ms重复、高电平1ms，占空比为1/20=5%。脉宽1ms、重复频率50Hz与占空比5%是三个不同表述；它是否代表某个舵机位置，必须由该设备协议确定。','A hypothetical pulse repeats every 20 ms and is high for 1 ms, giving 5% duty. Width 1 ms, repetition 50 Hz and duty 5% are different quantities. Whether that represents a servo position depends on the device protocol.'],
 ['vision-ops','一个被0包围的孤立前景像素，用3×3全1结构元素腐蚀后会消失，因为没有位置能容纳完整3×3前景邻域。开运算先腐蚀后膨胀，因此也可能删掉真实但很小的目标。','An isolated foreground pixel surrounded by zeros disappears under erosion with a 3×3 all-ones structuring element because no full neighborhood fits. Opening erodes then dilates, so it can also remove real small targets.'],
 ['estimation','一维直接测量模型H=1，先验x=10、方差P=4，测量z=14、独立噪声方差R=1。K=P/(P+R)=0.8，更新x=10+0.8(14−10)=13.2，后验方差(1−K)P=0.8。','For scalar direct observation H=1, prior x=10 with variance P=4 and measurement z=14 with independent noise variance R=1, K=0.8. The updated state is 10+0.8(14−10)=13.2 and posterior variance is (1−K)P=0.8.'],
 ['foc','假设电机有7对极，忽略零位偏置，电角度=极对数×机械角。机械转10°对应电角70°，完整机械一圈对应7个电周期；实际还必须校准角度方向与电角零位。','For seven pole pairs and zero offset, electrical angle equals pole pairs times mechanical angle. A 10° mechanical turn gives 70° electrical, and one mechanical revolution gives seven electrical cycles. Calibrate direction and electrical zero in real hardware.'],
 ['bio','合成序列[1,−1,1,−1]的均值为0，RMS=√((1²+1²+1²+1²)/4)=1，单位沿用输入的任意单位。零均值并不意味着没有波动；本例不代表任何人的生理测量。','Synthetic [1,−1,1,−1] has mean zero and RMS=√((1²+1²+1²+1²)/4)=1 in the input’s arbitrary units. Zero mean does not mean zero variation; this is not a measurement from a person.'],
 ['research','假设三次相同条件的延迟为8、10、12ms，均值10ms，样本标准差√((4+0+4)/(3−1))=2ms，n=3。标准差不等于均值置信区间；小样本也不能支持对所有场景的保证。','Three delays measured under the same conditions are 8,10,12 ms: mean 10 ms, sample standard deviation √((4+0+4)/(3−1))=2 ms, n=3. Standard deviation is not a confidence interval for the mean, and a small sample does not guarantee every scenario.'],
 ['analog-guide','10V供电、两只1kΩ分压，理想输出5V。10kΩ电压表并联下臂后，下臂1000∥10000≈909.09Ω，读数10×909.09/(1000+909.09)≈4.762V，误差约−4.76%。','A 10 V source and two 1 kΩ divider resistors ideally give 5 V. A 10 kΩ meter across the lower arm makes it about 909.09 Ω, producing about 4.762 V, a −4.76% loading error.'],
 ['hotair-guide','假设工件从25°C向350°C热源靠近，时间常数5s时，加热5s约230.44°C；若时间常数10s，同一时刻约152.88°C。这只是比较热惯性，不能把时间常数直接等同某个风量或喷嘴距离。','Assume heating from 25°C toward a 350°C source. After 5 s, time constant 5 s gives about 230.44°C, while 10 s gives about 152.88°C. This compares thermal lag; a time constant is not directly a specified airflow or nozzle distance.'],
 ['stencil-guide','方孔边长a=0.3mm、厚度t=0.12mm：理论体积V=a²t=0.0108mm³，面积比AR=a/(4t)=0.625。只把a改0.4mm，V=0.0192mm³、AR≈0.833；实际锡膏转移率另受工艺影响。','For square aperture a=0.3 mm and thickness t=0.12 mm, theoretical V=a²t=0.0108 mm³ and area ratio AR=a/(4t)=0.625. Changing only a to 0.4 mm gives V=0.0192 mm³ and AR≈0.833; actual paste transfer depends on process conditions.'],
 ['reflow-guide','课堂假定峰值225–245°C、TAL40–70s。240°C/60s在这两项假设内；240°C/20s的TAL不足。TAL指高于焊料液相线的总时间，不是峰值停留；真实窗口需按焊膏、器件和板卡资料实测确认。','The classroom assumes peak 225–245°C and TAL 40–70 s. 240°C/60 s satisfies these two assumptions; 240°C/20 s has insufficient TAL. TAL is total time above solder liquidus, not peak dwell. Real limits require the actual paste, components and board profile.']
].map(([id,zh,en])=>[id,[zh,en]]));
for(const lesson of LESSONS){const pair=WORKED_EXAMPLES7[lesson.id];if(pair){lesson.example=pair[0];EN_LESSONS[lesson.id].example=pair[1];}}
const LESSON_ROUTE=['start','kirchhoff','components','wiring-guide','meter','power','rc','scope','logic','mcu','motor-control','robot'];
// Further reading is local metadata; opening a reference requires a network connection.
const LESSON_REFERENCES7={};
for(const [ids,zh,en,url] of [
 [['start','kirchhoff','rc'],'OpenStax：RC电路与初始条件','OpenStax: RC circuits and initial conditions','https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/10-5-rc-circuits'],
 [['meter','wiring-guide','analog-guide'],'Fluke：断电测量电阻','Fluke: measuring resistance with power removed','https://www.fluke.com/en-us/learn/blog/digital-multimeters/how-to-measure-resistance'],
 [['scope','ac','adc','analog-guide'],'Tektronix：探头、加载与接地','Tektronix: probes, loading and grounding','https://www.tek.com/en/documents/whitepaper/abcs-probes-primer'],
 [['logic','protocol'],'NXP UM10204：I²C官方规范','NXP UM10204: I²C specification','https://www.nxp.com/docs/en/user-guide/UM10204.pdf'],
 [['mcu','boards'],'ST：STM32系统外设入门','ST: getting started with STM32 system peripherals','https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/Category%3AGetting_started_with_STM32_system_peripherals'],
 [['c-flow','c-memory'],'WG14 N1570：C11委员会草案（历史基础参考）','WG14 N1570: C11 committee draft (historical reference)','https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n1570.pdf'],
 [['python','research'],'Python：虚拟环境与包','Python: virtual environments and packages','https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html'],
 [['vision','vision-ops'],'OpenCV：图像阈值处理','OpenCV: image thresholding','https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d7/d4d/tutorial_py_thresholding.html'],
 [['linux-ros','robot'],'ROS robot_state_publisher：模型、关节状态与TF','ROS robot_state_publisher: model, joint states and TF','https://github.com/ros/robot_state_publisher'],
 [['esp-net'],'Espressif：ESP32 OTA与回滚','Espressif: ESP32 OTA and rollback','https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/stable/esp32/api-reference/system/ota.html'],
 [['rtos'],'FreeRTOS：内核教程（2018版，API以所用版本为准）','FreeRTOS: kernel tutorial (2018; check APIs against your version)','https://www.freertos.org/media/2018/161204_Mastering_the_FreeRTOS_Real_Time_Kernel-A_Hands-On_Tutorial_Guide.pdf'],
 [['solder','hotair-guide','reflow-guide'],'Indium：液相线上时间TAL（工艺以材料文件为准）','Indium: time above liquidus (use material-specific process limits)','https://www.indium.com/blog/stages-of-a-reflow-profile-part-iii/']
])for(const id of ids)(LESSON_REFERENCES7[id]??=[]).push({title:[zh,en],url});
const LESSON_GUIDE7=Object.fromEntries([
 ['start','区分电压、电流、电阻，并用单位解释一条LED回路。','Distinguish voltage, current and resistance and explain an LED loop with units.','保持330Ω，把供电从5V改到8V，先预测电流再对照；最后断开回路，解释电压和电流各发生什么。','Keep 330 Ω, change the source from 5 V to 8 V, predict current, then compare. Open the loop and explain voltage and current separately.','为什么断路时电源仍可能有5V，而支路电流是0？','Why can an open circuit still have 5 V at the source while branch current is zero?','电压描述两点电势差；持续直流电流还需要闭合路径。电源两端有电压并不表示每条支路都导通。','Voltage is a potential difference. Sustained DC current also needs a closed path; source voltage does not imply every branch conducts.','LED按导通压降2V近似；移动光点表示电流趋势，不表示真实电子速度。','The LED uses an approximate 2 V drop. Moving particles show current trends, not actual electron speed.'],
 ['kirchhoff','能给节点命名，计算串并联电阻并用守恒核对结果。','Name nodes, calculate series/parallel resistance and check conservation.','先手算两个1kΩ串联接5V的电流和中点电压，再在加载模型中改变仪表内阻，解释输出为何不再精确对半。','Calculate two 1 kΩ series resistors on 5 V, then change meter resistance in the loading model and explain the altered midpoint.','两个电阻只要画得平行就一定是并联吗？','Are two resistors parallel merely because they are drawn side by side?','不是。只有各自两端连接到同一对节点才是并联；图纸位置不决定电气连接。','No. They are parallel only when their ends share the same two nodes; drawing position does not define connection.','关联模型是等值分压器加电压表负载，不是任意网络求解器。','The model is an equal-resistor divider with voltmeter loading, not an arbitrary network solver.'],
 ['components','能核对元件的极性、引脚、关键额定值与模型适用范围。','Check polarity, pinout, essential ratings and model assumptions.','计算100Ω电阻两端5V时的电流与功率；再解释5V、2V LED、330Ω的功率为何不同，写出两张电路的差别。','Calculate current and power for 100 Ω across 5 V, then explain why the 5 V, 2 V LED and 330 Ω circuit dissipates differently.','只知道MOSFET阈值低于3.3V，就能保证3.3V驱动时发热很小吗？','Does a threshold below 3.3 V guarantee low MOSFET heating with a 3.3 V gate drive?','不能。阈值只是特定测试电流的导通起点，要查实际VGS下的RDS(on)、电流、开关损耗和热条件。','No. Threshold is an onset at a specified test current. Check RDS(on) at the actual VGS, current, switching loss and thermal conditions.','操作台展示电阻与固定压降LED；电容、MOSFET等器件行为在本章按各自模型解释。','The workbench shows a resistor and fixed-drop LED; other components use their own explanations in the lesson.'],
 ['wiring-guide','能把原理图节点变成连接表，并按断电检查后上电的顺序操作。','Translate nodes into a connection list and follow unpowered checks before enabling power.','沿电源正端→电阻→LED阳极→阴极→回流端逐点说明。设5V、330Ω，预测9.09mA，再切换断路或反接比较。','Trace source positive→resistor→LED anode→cathode→return. Set 5 V and 330 Ω, predict 9.09 mA, then compare open or reversed wiring.','LED不亮时为什么不能先盲目提高电压？','Why should you not raise voltage blindly when an LED does not light?','断路、反接、面包板连通组或供电问题都可能导致不亮，提高电压不会修复接线，还可能超过器件额定值。','Open wiring, reversed polarity, breadboard groups or power faults can all cause darkness. More voltage does not repair them and may exceed ratings.','只判断本教学回路；真实面包板内部连通与接触可靠性需要单独测量。','This is one teaching circuit; real breadboard connectivity and contact quality require separate checks.'],
 ['meter','能分别选择功能、量程与插孔，并解释读数对应的两个节点或支路。','Choose function, range and jack separately and relate the reading to nodes or a branch.','用V⎓、VΩ/COM先测5V电源，再测LED约2V与电阻约3V。测电流前关闭模拟电源、换电流档与插孔、串入支路后再上电。','Use V⎓ with VΩ/COM to read the 5 V source, about 2 V across the LED and 3 V across the resistor. Switch power off before selecting current input and inserting it in series.','红笔在mA孔时，把旋钮调到电压档就能安全跨接电源吗？','With the red lead in mA, does selecting voltage make it safe to bridge a source?','不能。插孔的实际内部通路不会因名称相似而消失，必须核对档位与插孔，并按具体仪表说明操作。','No. The jack’s actual internal path still matters. Match function and jack and follow the specific meter instructions.','本平台有直流电压/电流、电阻、通断四种教学模式；额定值和30Ω蜂鸣阈值仅属于本模型。','This model provides DC voltage/current, resistance and continuity. Ratings and its 30 Ω beep threshold are classroom model choices.'],
 ['power','能区分电压设定和限流，并手算CV转CC后的工作点。','Distinguish voltage setting from current limit and calculate the CV/CC operating point.','设5V、330Ω，比较20mA与5mA限流；记录电流和输出电压，解释5mA时为何约为3.65V。','At 5 V and 330 Ω, compare 20 mA and 5 mA limits. Record current and voltage and explain the approximately 3.65 V output at 5 mA.','把限流设为1A是否会向所有负载强制输出1A？','Does a 1 A current limit force 1 A through every load?','不会。未触及限流时由输出电压与负载决定电流；负载需求超过限值时，电源降低电压进入CC。','No. Below the limit, voltage and load determine current. Above the limit, the supply lowers voltage and enters CC.','本操作台以理想限流电源驱动固定压降LED；电子负载CC/CR原理另在正文解释。','The bench models an ideal current-limited source feeding a fixed-drop LED. Electronic-load CC/CR concepts are explained in the text.'],
 ['rc','能换算R与C单位，计算时间常数并使用正确初始电压。','Convert R/C units, calculate time constant and retain the correct initial voltage.','复位后设10kΩ和100μF，记录约1s时的3.16V与5s时的4.97V；充电途中改放电，预测从当前电压开始的变化。','Reset at 10 kΩ and 100 μF. Compare about 3.16 V at 1 s and 4.97 V at 5 s, then switch during charging and predict discharge from the current voltage.','如果只充到3V就开始放电，一秒后的电压应从5V还是3V计算？','If charging reaches only 3 V before discharge, should the next second be calculated from 5 V or 3 V?','从3V计算。时间常数1s时，经过1s约为3/e=1.10V；开关动作不会瞬间把电容电压变为满电。','Use 3 V. With τ=1 s, one second gives 3/e≈1.10 V. Switching does not instantly make the capacitor fully charged.','采用理想一阶RC，忽略漏电、ESR、介质与探头加载；液位是电压的可视化。','This is an ideal first-order RC model, omitting leakage, ESR, dielectric and probe loading. Fill level visualizes voltage.'],
 ['scope','能把格数换成电压和时间，并解释触发、探头倍率与参考地。','Convert divisions into voltage/time and explain trigger, probe ratio and reference.','设1Hz、幅值2V、1V/div，预测4Vpp跨4格；调整时基与上升触发，再改为自由滚动，比较显示稳定性。','Set 1 Hz, 2 V amplitude and 1 V/div; predict a 4 Vpp trace spanning four divisions. Change timebase and rising trigger, then compare free-running display.','调大V/div后波形在屏幕上变矮，是否表示信号电压减小？','If increasing V/div makes the trace shorter, has the source voltage decreased?','不一定。每格代表的电压增大，固定信号会占更少格；应把格数乘V/div再比较物理量。','Not necessarily. Larger voltage per division makes a fixed signal occupy fewer divisions. Compare physical voltage by multiplying height by scale.','时基、垂直档位和上升锁相作用于教学正弦信号；没有真实ADC采集、带宽或噪声模型。','Timebase, vertical scale and rising phase lock act on a teaching sine. This is not a real ADC acquisition, bandwidth or noise model.'],
 ['logic','能从UART帧分清起始、数据、停止位，并按LSB优先读出字节。','Identify UART start/data/stop bits and read a byte least-significant bit first.','发送0x41，手写数据位1、0、0、0、0、0、1、0，再对照帧动画。改变字节，保持帧格式不变重新推导。','Send 0x41 and write data bits 1,0,0,0,0,0,1,0 before comparing the animation. Change the byte and repeat with the same frame format.','写成01000001的二进制数，UART是否从最左边一位开始发送？','Does UART transmit the leftmost bit first in the written binary value 01000001?','本例不是。书写习惯高位在左，UART数据从D0最低位开始；起始位和停止位也不属于这8个数据位。','Not in this example. Written binary places the high bit left, while UART sends D0 first. Start and stop bits are separate from the eight data bits.','操作台直接演示UART 8N1；I²C/SPI在课程中讲解，不伪装成当前正在捕获的总线。','The bench directly demonstrates UART 8N1. I²C/SPI are explained in the lesson rather than presented as live captures.'],
 ['mcu','能把引脚动作对应到寄存器、外设时钟、中断与DMA的职责。','Relate pin behavior to registers, peripheral clocks, interrupts and DMA roles.','用CPU单步观察初始化、累加、比较和跳转；另外画一张GPIO→定时器→ADC→DMA的数据路线，并标出CPU在哪些步骤参与。','Step through initialization, addition, comparison and branch. Separately draw GPIO→timer→ADC→DMA and mark where the CPU participates.','有了DMA，CPU是否完全不用处理采样任务？','Does DMA remove all CPU responsibility for sampling?','不是。CPU仍需配置外设与DMA，管理缓冲区、完成/错误事件和数据处理；DMA减少逐次搬运的负担。','No. The CPU still configures peripherals and DMA, manages buffers and completion/errors, and processes data. DMA reduces per-transfer copying.','开发板与CPU是通用教学模型，不对应某款MCU寄存器，不烧录真实固件。','The board and CPU are generic teaching models, not a specific MCU register map or real firmware programmer.'],
 ['motor-control','能把电机、驱动器、反馈与PID分开，并比较扰动前后的响应。','Separate motor, driver, feedback and PID and compare disturbance responses.','先保持目标不变，比较Ki=0与Ki=1的最终误差；待稳定后施加负载，记录最大偏差与恢复时间。另手算0.5N·m、300rpm的功率。','Hold the target and compare final error with Ki=0 and Ki=1. After settling, apply load and record deviation/recovery. Separately calculate power at 0.5 N·m and 300 rpm.','为什么只有P控制时可能需要保留稳态误差？','Why can proportional-only control retain steady error?','对象需要持续输出抵消负载，而P输出等于Kp乘误差；若误差为零就没有该输出。积分可积累所需补偿，但必须稳定且不超限。','The plant may need sustained effort against load, while P output is Kp times error. Zero error gives no P effort. Integral can provide compensation if the loop remains stable and within limits.','对象是归一化一阶响应，百分比不是实测rpm；不用于直接给真实电机或FOC整定。','The plant is a normalized first-order response. Percent is not measured rpm and these gains do not tune a real motor or FOC system.'],
 ['robot','能使用基座坐标解释两连杆正逆运动学与可达范围。','Explain two-link forward/inverse kinematics and reach in the base frame.','两杆各110mm，先预测目标(110,110)的距离与一组关节角；拖动目标观察关节和轨迹，再尝试距离大于220mm的点。','With two 110 mm links, predict reach and one joint solution for (110,110), then drag the target and inspect motion. Try a target beyond 220 mm.','两根连杆角度平滑变化，末端一定沿直线移动吗？','Do smoothly changing joint angles guarantee a straight end-point path?','不一定。末端坐标由两个角的三角关系共同决定；直线轨迹需要先规划任务空间中间点再求逆解。','No. End-point coordinates depend trigonometrically on both joints. A straight path needs task-space intermediate targets and inverse solutions.','这是水平平面两连杆运动学模型，未计算碰撞、重力、惯量和驱动力矩。','This is horizontal planar two-link kinematics, without collision, gravity, inertia or actuator torque calculations.'],
 ['solder','能把温度设定、热传递、润湿与焊后检查区分开。','Distinguish setpoint, heat transfer, wetting and post-solder inspection.','固定热源设定，观察工件温度从室温上升；切断加热再看冷却，解释为什么显示设定值不等于焊点实际温度。','Hold source temperature, observe the workpiece warming from room temperature, then remove heat and observe cooling. Explain setpoint versus joint temperature.','焊点看起来很亮是否足以证明连接可靠？','Is a shiny joint enough to establish reliability?','不足。还需看润湿、连接形状、桥连与损伤，结合断电电气检查；外观不能单独证明内部缺陷或长期可靠性。','No. Inspect wetting, geometry, bridges and damage and perform unpowered electrical checks. Appearance alone does not establish internal quality or long-term reliability.','热曲线是集中参数趋势示意，不计算真实焊料相变、焊点强度或损伤阈值。','The lumped thermal curve is illustrative; it does not calculate solder phase change, joint strength or damage thresholds.'],
 ['protocol','能把电气层、时序、帧格式和消息含义分开，并解释常见排错顺序。','Separate electrical layer, timing, framing and meaning and explain a debugging order.','先按UART 8N1手算9600baud每帧时间，再观察字节动画；另画I²C地址、方向位与第九时钟ACK，指出谁驱动SDA。','Calculate UART 8N1 frame time at 9600 baud and observe the byte animation. Separately draw I²C address, direction and ninth-clock ACK ownership.','看到正确字节能否证明电气波形和整个链路都可靠？','Does one correctly decoded byte prove electrical and whole-link reliability?','不能。阈值、边沿、噪声、错误率、时序余量和不同场景仍需测量；一次成功只说明当次数据可被解码。','No. Thresholds, edges, noise, error rate and timing margin across conditions still need measurement. One success establishes only that event’s decoding.','UART动画帮助读帧；CAN/I²C/SPI内容以协议解释和手算为主，不连接真实总线。','UART animation supports frame reading. CAN/I²C/SPI use explanations and worked reasoning without a hardware bus connection.'],
 ['vision','能按明确阈值规则生成掩膜，并区分像素统计与物体识别。','Apply an explicit threshold rule and distinguish pixel statistics from recognition.','先预测阈值100升到150后前景数如何变化，再看掩膜与数量；记录阈值、前景比例，以及图像变化会怎样影响结论。','Predict the foreground change from threshold 100 to 150, then compare mask and count. Record threshold, fraction and the effect of changed images.','一个灰度直方图能唯一确定物体在图中的位置吗？','Can a grayscale histogram uniquely determine object location?','不能。它统计每个灰度有多少像素，不保留像素位置；不同布局可能有完全相同的直方图。','No. It counts intensity values without retaining locations. Different layouts can have the same histogram.','图像由本地数学图案生成；相机模型不访问摄像头，也不执行真实物体分类。','The image is a local synthetic pattern. The camera model neither accesses a camera nor classifies real objects.'],
 ['project','能写清系统接口、验收指标和失败恢复流程。','Specify system interfaces, acceptance metrics and failure recovery.','让两轮同速前进，再让左右轮反向等速旋转；用速度与轮距预测运动，把停车和恢复条件写进项目测试计划。','Run equal wheel speeds, then equal and opposite speeds. Predict motion from speed and track width and add stopping/recovery conditions to a test plan.','一段成功演示视频能否代替完整项目验收？','Can one successful demo video replace project acceptance?','不能。还需明确条件、重复次数、失败模式和通过标准，并保留数据支持性能结论。','No. Define conditions, repeats, failure modes and pass criteria and preserve data supporting performance claims.','小车采用理想差速几何，无轮胎打滑、地形接触、导航或真实急停认证。','The rover uses ideal differential-drive geometry, without slip, terrain contact, navigation or certified emergency-stop behavior.'],
 ['c-memory','能解释地址、生命周期、数组边界与寄存器访问语义。','Explain addresses, lifetime, array bounds and register access semantics.','手算0xA5与0x0F的结果，再单步观察程序何时更新寄存器、何时写内存；说明这与C指针访问有哪些相通和不同。','Calculate 0xA5 AND 0x0F, then step the CPU to identify register updates and memory writes and compare with C pointer access.','volatile是否会自动把多任务共享变量变成线程安全？','Does volatile make a shared variable thread-safe?','不会。它不提供原子性、互斥或完整的跨任务同步，仍需符合平台要求的同步设计。','No. It does not provide atomicity, mutual exclusion or complete inter-task synchronization; platform-appropriate synchronization is still needed.','CPU单步只演示有限指令集与存储变化，不执行C指针或模拟C语言未定义行为。','The CPU stepper illustrates a finite ISA and storage changes, not C pointer execution or C undefined behavior.'],
 ['boards','能用接口、时限、内存和功耗需求解释平台选择。','Justify a platform using interfaces, deadlines, memory and power.','为320×240 RGB565图像算单帧与双缓冲内存；列出控制周期、所需外设和软件版本，再比较MCU、SBC与加速平台。','Budget single and double buffers for 320×240 RGB565, list deadlines/interfaces/software versions, then compare MCU, SBC and accelerator roles.','某芯片有SPI外设，是否保证开发板任意针脚都能用SPI？','Does a chip’s SPI peripheral mean any board pin can provide SPI?','不保证。要同时核对芯片引脚复用、开发板布线与连接器、核心或驱动支持。','No. Check chip pin multiplexing, board routing/connectors and core or driver support together.','开发板模型用于识别芯片与接口位置，不提供具体板型性能、引脚图或烧录能力。','The board model identifies generic chip/interface locations, not a specific board’s performance, pinout or programming support.'],
 ['sensors','能将原始数据换算为单位，并解释校准、延迟和有效性。','Convert raw data into units and explain calibration, delay and validity.','用两点标定0→100、10→1100推导raw=600时的值；在小车测距示意里改变朝向，说明单点距离为何不同。','Use calibration 0→100 and 10→1100 to convert raw 600. Rotate the rover and explain changes in its single-direction range.','把噪声滤得很小是否说明测量一定准确？','Does low noise after filtering guarantee accuracy?','不说明。固定偏差、坐标错误、时间延迟和无效数据仍可能存在；需要独立参考与有效性判断。','No. Bias, frame error, delay and invalid data can remain; use independent references and validity checks.','测距射线是理想几何距离，无噪声、反射或盲区模型，不能代表完整避障。','The range ray is ideal geometry with no noise, reflection or blind-zone model and does not represent complete obstacle avoidance.'],
 ['rtos','能定义任务期限、队列容量与锁的职责，并解释过载时的行为。','Define deadlines, queue limits and lock roles and explain overload behavior.','画采样→队列→控制→日志的数据流。若每秒产200条只消费100条，计算积压速度，并设计满队列策略。','Draw sampling→queue→control→logging. With 200 produced and 100 consumed per second, calculate backlog growth and define a full-queue policy.','把队列容量加倍，能否解决长期生产快于消费的问题？','Does doubling queue capacity solve permanently faster production than consumption?','不能，只会延后溢出。需改变吞吐、降低输入、允许明确丢弃或采用背压等策略。','No. It delays overflow. Change throughput, reduce input or define dropping/backpressure behavior.','CPU可帮助理解顺序；本平台不实现真实RTOS调度、优先级反转或任务切换时延。','The CPU supports reasoning about sequence, not actual RTOS scheduling, priority inversion or context-switch timing.'],
 ['pcb','能将网络、封装、回流、制造文件和上电验证连成流程。','Connect nets, footprints, returns, manufacturing files and power-up verification.','在示例中分别把线宽和间距调到0.2mm上下，说明判定依据；写出还需要由专业EDA和板厂检查的项目。','Move width and spacing above and below 0.2 mm, explain the classroom check, and list what still requires EDA and fabricator verification.','几何规则通过后，能否据此确定走线能持续通过5A？','Does passing geometric rules establish that a trace can continuously carry 5 A?','不能。载流与温升还依铜厚、长度、散热、叠层和环境等条件，本模型没有求解这些因素。','No. Current and temperature depend on copper, length, cooling, stack-up and environment, which this model does not solve.','只检查两项给定几何条件，不执行真正全板ERC/DRC，不生成投产文件。','Only two illustrative geometry rules are checked; this is not whole-board ERC/DRC or fabrication output.'],
 ['ml','能区分训练、验证、测试，并解释一次Q-learning更新与策略结果。','Distinguish train/validation/test and explain a Q-learning update and learned policy.','先手算Q更新例题，再改变训练回合数观察网格策略；记录是否到达目标以及出现循环，而不只记录回合数。','Calculate the Q update, then vary training episodes and inspect the grid policy. Record goal completion and loops, not only episode count.','固定随机种子并成功一次，是否证明策略面对所有条件都稳定？','Does one success with a fixed seed establish robustness in all conditions?','不能。固定种子帮助重现，需要其他种子和独立场景评估成功率、失败方式与假设边界。','No. A seed enables repetition. Other seeds and independent scenarios are needed to assess success, failure and assumption limits.','操作台训练小型离散网格Q表，不训练神经网络，不训练真实机器人。','The workbench trains a small discrete grid Q-table, not a neural network or real robot.'],
 ['linux-ros','能追踪节点、话题、时间戳和超时行为，并区分URDF与TF发布。','Trace nodes, topics, timestamps and timeout behavior and distinguish URDF from TF publication.','观察连接正常时的消息和小车运动，再断开控制话题；记录最后消息时间与超时停车，说明重连后还应检查哪些状态。','Observe messages and rover motion, disconnect the command topic, and record message age and timeout stop. Explain checks needed on reconnection.','URDF文件加载后，是否会自己持续发布所有TF变换？','Does loading a URDF file itself continuously publish every TF transform?','不会。需要相应节点结合模型与关节状态发布变换；模型文件、状态数据和发布过程各有职责。','No. A node uses the model and joint states to publish transforms; file, state data and publisher have different responsibilities.','ROS面板是本地消息流程示意，未连接DDS、ROS运行时或任何真实设备。','The ROS panel is local message-flow illustration without DDS, a ROS runtime or real devices.']
].map(([id,gz,ge,pz,pe,qz,qe,az,ae,lz,le])=>[id,{goal:[gz,ge],practice:[pz,pe],question:[qz,qe],answer:[az,ae],labNote:[lz,le],labMode:'simulation'}]));
Object.assign(LESSON_GUIDE7,Object.fromEntries([
 ['ac','能区分幅值、偏置、相位和有效值，并说明阻抗为何随频率变化。','Distinguish amplitude, offset, phase and RMS and explain frequency-dependent impedance.','在正弦示意中取幅值2V，手算4Vpp和1.414Vrms；另加2V直流偏置作纸面推导，比较总RMS与交流分量RMS。','Use a 2 V peak sine and calculate 4 Vpp and 1.414 Vrms. On paper add a 2 V offset and compare total RMS with AC-component RMS.','所有波形的有效值都能用峰值除以√2吗？','Is peak divided by √2 the RMS value of every waveform?','不能。该关系适用于零偏置正弦；其他波形应按平方平均再开方，并说明统计时间窗与直流分量。','No. It applies to a zero-offset sine. Other waveforms need square-average-square-root with a defined window and DC component.','操作台生成正弦并演示相位；偏置和阻抗在本课手算，不进行完整交流网络求解。','The bench generates a sine and illustrates phase; offset and impedance are worked calculations, not full AC-network solutions.'],
 ['adc','能分别估算采样间隔、量化步长与混叠频率，并检查输入建立条件。','Estimate sample interval, quantization step and alias frequency and check settling conditions.','计算12位3.3V跨度的LSB，再画10kSa/s采8kHz正弦的采样点，解释为何能出现2kHz别名。','Calculate the LSB for 12 bits over 3.3 V, then reason through 10 kSa/s sampling an 8 kHz sine and its 2 kHz alias.','已经产生混叠后，只用软件低通能否恢复原始高频信号？','After aliasing, can software low-pass filtering recover the original high-frequency signal?','一般不能唯一恢复，因为不同原信号可能产生同样样本。需在采样前限制带宽并选择合适采样率。','Generally it cannot uniquely recover it: different signals can produce identical samples. Limit analog bandwidth before sampling and choose an appropriate sample rate.','关联波形帮助理解时间轴；本平台未实现真实ADC量化、采样电容或混叠采集器。','The related wave illustrates time; this platform does not implement an actual ADC quantizer, acquisition capacitor or aliasing capture model.'],
 ['opamp','能在工作范围内计算负反馈增益，并判断虚短近似何时失效。','Calculate negative-feedback gain within operating limits and identify failure of the virtual-short approximation.','画同相放大电路，设Rf=90kΩ、Rg=10kΩ、输入0.2V，先算2V输出，再列需要核对的数据手册范围。','Draw a non-inverting stage with Rf=90 kΩ, Rg=10 kΩ and 0.2 V input, calculate 2 V output and list datasheet limits to check.','输出已经饱和时，能否继续认定两个输入端电压相等？','Can the inputs still be assumed equal when the output is saturated?','通常不能。虚短依赖有效负反馈和线性工作条件，饱和后应重新检查模型与边界。','Usually not. The approximation relies on effective negative feedback and linear operating conditions, so saturation requires reconsidering the model.','本课以电路图推导为主；关联基础回路不求解运放增益、频率响应或稳定性。','This lesson uses circuit reasoning; the basic related loop does not solve op-amp gain, frequency response or stability.'],
 ['protection','能沿完整供电与回流路径识别损耗，并把保护措施对应到具体故障。','Trace power/return losses and match protection to specific faults.','手算12V降3.3V、0.2A的LDO损耗，再在限流模型里比较CV/CC；写明保险丝、反接保护和TVS各应对哪类故障。','Calculate LDO loss from 12 V to 3.3 V at 0.2 A, compare CV/CC, and identify the faults addressed by fusing, reverse protection and a TVS.','加一颗大电容能否自动解决所有电源瞬态和接地噪声？','Does adding a large capacitor automatically solve every transient and ground-noise problem?','不能。还要看ESR/ESL、回路、频率、负载变化和稳压器稳定性；必须检查完整能量与回流路径。','No. ESR/ESL, loop geometry, frequency, load changes and regulator stability all matter; assess complete energy and return paths.','限流操作台只展示理想CV/CC；没有ESD、热、线缆寄生或电池化学模型。','The supply bench shows ideal CV/CC, without ESD, thermal, cable-parasitic or battery-chemistry models.'],
 ['c-flow','能把输入事件转换成清晰的状态和输出，并解释非阻塞定时。','Map input events to explicit state/output and explain nonblocking timing.','画IDLE、RUN、FAULT三态图，标出启动、停止、故障与复位；为未知状态写默认输出，再描述500ms定时如何不阻塞通信。','Draw IDLE, RUN and FAULT with start/stop/fault/reset transitions, specify an unknown-state output and describe a 500 ms nonblocking timer.','一个变量能表示某个数，就一定能安全完成所有中间计算吗？','If a variable can hold a result, are all intermediate calculations necessarily safe?','不一定。运算类型、整数提升、符号和溢出都影响中间结果，需要核对整条表达式。','No. Operand types, promotions, signs and overflow affect intermediate values; inspect the whole expression.','CPU单步帮助理解分支与顺序，不编译C源代码，也不自动验证实际状态机。','The CPU stepper supports reasoning about branches and order, not C compilation or automatic verification of a real state machine.'],
 ['cpp','能说明对象不变量、资源所有权与RAII，并识别借用对象的生命周期。','Explain invariants, ownership and RAII and recognize borrowed-object lifetime.','为串口缓冲区画拥有者和借用者；逐一检查正常返回、提前返回和错误分支如何释放资源，并列实时路径禁止的阻塞操作。','Draw ownership and borrowing for a serial buffer and check cleanup on normal, early and error returns. List blocking operations excluded from the real-time path.','用了智能指针是否就消除了所有生命周期与并发问题？','Do smart pointers remove every lifetime and concurrency problem?','没有。借用失效、循环共享、数据竞争和不合适的释放时机仍需设计和验证。','No. Invalid borrowing, shared cycles, data races and unsuitable destruction timing still require design and verification.','这是接口与资源管理推演；平台没有C++编译器或真实堆分配器测量。','This is interface/resource reasoning; the platform has no C++ compiler or measurement of a real heap allocator.'],
 ['python','能为数据脚本定义输入格式、单位、错误处理和可复现环境。','Specify data format, units, error handling and a reproducible environment.','取三行时间与电压数据，手算平均值，写出缺失字段和异常单位的处理规则，再记录环境与输出文件命名。','Use three timestamp/voltage rows, calculate the mean, define missing-field and unit-error handling, and record environment and output naming.','为什么应该保留原始数据，而把清洗结果另存？','Why preserve raw data and save cleaned data separately?','原始数据允许重放和发现清洗误删，也能区分采集问题与算法问题；覆盖后会丢失这条证据链。','Raw data permits replay and detection of mistaken cleaning and separates acquisition errors from processing errors. Overwriting removes that evidence.','视觉工作台是浏览器内的合成图像演示，不执行Python或访问串口。','The related vision bench is an in-browser synthetic-image demonstration, not Python execution or serial-port access.'],
 ['cpu-arch','能单步追踪PC、寄存器、比较标志与内存，并说明教学ISA的范围。','Trace PC, registers, comparison state and memory and explain the teaching ISA scope.','复位累加程序，每步先预测PC与和，再单步核对；最终检查内存0是否为15，并说明跳转发生的条件。','Reset the sum program, predict PC and sum before each step, then verify memory zero contains 15 and explain the branch condition.','课堂PC增加1是否说明所有真实CPU的指令长度都是1字节？','Does a teaching PC increment of one mean every real instruction is one byte?','不是。本例PC是指令序号；真实指令地址、长度和取指行为取决于体系结构。','No. This PC is an instruction index; actual addresses, lengths and fetching depend on the architecture.','执行的是有限教学指令集，不是ARM、RISC-V或x86机器码。','The engine executes a finite teaching ISA, not ARM, RISC-V or x86 machine code.'],
 ['51','能结合具体时钟与定时器模式计算节拍，并识别8051兼容芯片差异。','Calculate timing from the actual clock/mode and identify differences among 8051 derivatives.','假设定时器每1μs计数，计算1ms需1000计数及16位预装值64536；列出使此估算失效的外设配置变化。','Assume a 1 μs timer tick, calculate 1000 counts for 1 ms and a 16-bit preload of 64536, then list configurations that invalidate the assumptions.','同一晶振频率下，经典12T与1T兼容芯片运行同一延时循环必然同速吗？','Do classic 12T and 1T-compatible parts necessarily run the same delay loop at equal speed with the same crystal?','不必然。机器周期、指令时序与外设分频可能不同，必须查具体芯片与配置。','No. Machine cycles, instruction timings and peripheral divisors can differ; use the actual part and configuration.','通用CPU或UART示意帮助理解时序；没有8051寄存器级仿真。','Generic CPU/UART demonstrations support timing concepts but are not register-level 8051 simulation.'],
 ['arduino','能区分板型、核心、库与上传过程，核对GPIO和PWM能力。','Distinguish board, core, library and upload and check GPIO/PWM capability.','写下目标板型、LED引脚和有效电平，计算外接LED限流，再列出编译、上传、引脚测量和复位后运行四步的证据。','Record board, LED pin and active level, calculate external LED current limiting, and specify evidence for compilation, upload, pin behavior and operation after reset.','analogWrite这个名字是否保证所有引脚都输出真实模拟电压？','Does the name analogWrite guarantee a true analog voltage on every pin?','不保证。很多平台输出PWM，只有部分具备DAC的指定引脚可输出DAC电压，能力依板卡核心而异。','No. Many platforms produce PWM; only some specified DAC-capable pins provide DAC voltage, depending on board and core.','关联LED回路解释输出与限流；本页不连接USB、不编译和上传草图。','The related LED loop explains output and limiting; this page does not connect USB, compile or upload sketches.'],
 ['esp-net','能定义网络超时、应用分帧、OTA验证与恢复策略。','Define timeouts, application framing and OTA verification/recovery.','画接收缓冲如何拼成完整消息，再列断网、半包、旧包与升级中断四种故障的处理；用本地消息流观察命令超时。','Draw how a receive buffer assembles messages, define behavior for disconnection/partial/stale data and interrupted update, and observe command timeout in the local flow model.','文件校验和正确是否证明它一定来自可信发布者？','Does a correct file checksum prove a trusted publisher created it?','不是。它可检测意外损坏；可信来源还需要经过正确验证的认证或数字签名机制。','No. It can detect accidental corruption; trusted origin needs correctly verified authentication or a digital signature mechanism.','消息操作台解释本地超时；没有Wi-Fi、ESP-IDF、OTA刷写或网络连接。','The message bench illustrates local timeout, without Wi-Fi, ESP-IDF, OTA flashing or a network connection.'],
 ['bus-physical','能区分收发器、电气拓扑、终端匹配与上层协议。','Distinguish transceiver, topology, termination and upper-layer protocol.','为两端各120Ω的理想总线手算断电等效60Ω，再解释为何该结果仍不能证明运行时波形正确。','Calculate 60 Ω for two ideal 120 Ω end terminators, then explain why that reading does not prove correct operating waveforms.','RS-485的A/B线能否直接接到3.3V UART引脚替代收发器？','Can RS-485 A/B connect directly to 3.3 V UART pins instead of a transceiver?','不能。电气驱动与允许电压范围不同，通常需要符合要求的收发器与保护设计。','No. Drivers and allowed voltage ranges differ; a suitable transceiver and protection design are normally required.','本课按总线图和公式推演；UART位动画不模拟差分传输线反射。','This lesson uses bus diagrams and calculations; UART bit animation does not model differential-line reflections.'],
 ['rc-link','能区分脉宽与数字协议，并把失联检测追踪到执行器响应。','Distinguish pulse-width/digital protocols and trace link loss to actuator response.','写出50Hz更新对应20ms周期，按课堂假设比较正常更新与超时，列明真正接收端和执行器端分别需要记录什么。','Convert 50 Hz updates to a 20 ms period, compare normal/stale commands under a classroom assumption, and list receiver and actuator evidence.','发送端显示断线，是否能证明接收端已经让执行器停止？','Does a disconnected transmitter display prove the receiver stopped the actuator?','不能。需要验证接收端超时判断、实际驱动输出和运动状态，且恢复条件必须明确。','No. Verify receiver timeout, driver output and actual motion, with explicit recovery conditions.','PWM台架演示占空比与惯性；不生成DShot、CRSF或SBUS真实控制帧。','The PWM rig illustrates duty cycle and inertia; it does not generate real DShot, CRSF or SBUS command frames.'],
 ['vision-ops','能解释滤波、形态学、连通域和标定各解决什么问题。','Explain distinct roles of filtering, morphology, components and calibration.','先比较两个阈值掩膜，再在纸上对一个小二值图按3×3结构元素推演腐蚀与膨胀；记录小目标可能消失的原因。','Compare two threshold masks, then work erosion/dilation on a small binary diagram with a 3×3 element and explain loss of small targets.','像素面积1000是否可以直接写成1000mm²？','Can an area of 1000 pixels be reported directly as 1000 mm²?','不可以。需成像尺度、标定和几何条件；透视与目标深度都会影响像素与物理尺寸的关系。','No. Scale, calibration and geometry are required; perspective and depth affect the pixel-to-physical relation.','操作台只实现阈值与合成图像；形态学、相机标定和真实测量在本课推演。','The bench implements synthetic-image thresholding; morphology, calibration and physical measurement are worked conceptually.'],
 ['estimation','能用一维预测与测量算出创新、增益和更新结果，并解释假设。','Compute scalar innovation, gain and update and explain assumptions.','用预测10/P=4、测量14/R=1计算K=0.8与结果13.2；再只增大R，说明结果为何更靠近预测。','Use prediction 10/P=4 and measurement 14/R=1 to get K=0.8 and 13.2, then increase only R and explain movement toward the prediction.','把R调得很大、曲线更平滑，是否等于估计更准确？','Does a larger R and smoother estimate necessarily mean greater accuracy?','不等于。它降低测量权重，可能保留模型偏差；要检查独立误差、创新、延迟与可观测性。','No. It lowers measurement weight and may retain model bias; examine independent error, innovation, delay and observability.','关联控制曲线只帮助理解动态误差；没有完整卡尔曼滤波器或传感器融合求解。','The related control trace illustrates dynamic error, not a complete Kalman filter or sensor-fusion solver.'],
 ['foc','能追踪三相测量、坐标变换、电流环和PWM的完整控制链。','Trace phase measurements, transforms, current loops and PWM as one control chain.','画Clarke→Park→电流调节→逆变换→PWM流程，标出角度与采样时刻；计算7对极电机转10°机械角对应70°电角。','Draw Clarke→Park→current control→inverse transforms→PWM, mark angle/sampling timing, and calculate 70° electrical for 10° mechanical at seven pole pairs.','错误极对数或电角度能否通过提高PID增益修好？','Can higher PID gains fix an incorrect pole-pair count or electrical angle?','不能。坐标和测量链有误时控制作用方向已错，应先校准模型、方向与采样。','No. An incorrect frame or measurement chain changes control direction; first calibrate model, direction and sampling.','关联PID仅为标量基础对象；本课不模拟三相逆变器或提供实机FOC参数。','The related PID is a scalar foundation model, not a three-phase inverter simulation or source of hardware FOC gains.'],
 ['bio','能区分信号来源、特征、伪迹与研究有效性，并保持人体连接边界。','Distinguish signal source, features, artifacts and validity while respecting human-connection limits.','用合成序列1、−1、1、−1计算均值和RMS，再写按受试者/会话划分数据的方案及误触发记录指标。','Calculate mean and RMS for synthetic 1,−1,1,−1, then define subject/session splits and false-trigger metrics.','生物信号分类准确率高，是否就足以直接控制人体辅助关节？','Is high biosignal classification accuracy enough to directly control an assistive joint?','不足。还需独立安全、设备、伦理与系统验证；先把结果用于低风险界面或离线研究。','No. Independent safety, equipment, ethics and system validation remain necessary; begin with low-risk interfaces or offline analysis.','这里只使用概念与合成数据，无人体采集、医疗诊断或人体执行机构控制。','This lesson uses concepts and synthetic data, without human acquisition, medical diagnosis or assistive-actuator control.'],
 ['research','能写可证伪问题、比较条件、误差指标和复现记录。','Write a falsifiable question, matched conditions, error metrics and reproduction record.','对8、10、12求均值与样本标准差，给结果补齐单位、n与条件；再为两种滤波方法拟定相同延迟预算下的比较。','Compute mean/sample deviation for 8,10,12 and add units, n and conditions, then design a two-filter comparison under equal delay limits.','只保留最好的一次结果，别人是否能可靠复现你的结论？','Can others reliably reproduce a conclusion from only the best run?','通常不能。必须保留有效重复、失败和预定排除规则，并说明原始数据、版本、参数和环境。','Usually not. Preserve valid repeats, failures and predefined exclusions and document raw data, versions, parameters and conditions.','仿真和计算可用于提出假设；本平台不替代真实实验数据或统计检验。','Simulation and calculations can support hypotheses; the platform does not replace measured data or statistical testing.'],
 ['analog-guide','能计算仪表输入电阻对分压器的加载误差。','Calculate divider loading from finite meter input resistance.','设电源10V、两只分压电阻各1kΩ、表内阻10kΩ，预测4.762V；增大内阻，观察读数趋近5V。','Use 10 V, two 1 kΩ divider resistors and a 10 kΩ meter to predict 4.762 V, then increase input resistance toward the ideal 5 V.','显示更多小数位，是否会减小电压表对电路的加载？','Do more displayed digits reduce a voltmeter’s circuit loading?','不会。加载由实际输入阻抗等因素决定，小数位主要影响显示分辨率。','No. Loading depends on actual input impedance and related factors; digits mainly affect display resolution.','操作台计算电压表加载；电流表负担以文本算例解释，未模拟仪表内部完整电路。','The bench calculates voltage loading. Current burden is a text example, not a full internal meter-circuit simulation.'],
 ['hotair-guide','能区分热源与工件温度，并说明气流、几何和热容量如何改变工艺。','Distinguish source/workpiece temperature and explain airflow, geometry and thermal mass.','在热模型中固定设定温度，记录工件逐渐上升与停热后下降；另列真实返修需要监测的部位和材料限制。','Hold the thermal setpoint and record workpiece heating/cooling, then list real rework measurement locations and material limits.','热风枪显示350°C是否代表芯片焊点也正好350°C？','Does a 350°C hot-air display mean the joint is exactly 350°C?','不代表。传热、距离、风量、板卡热容量和时间造成差异，应对工件实际测温。','No. Heat transfer, distance, airflow, board thermal mass and time create differences; measure the workpiece.','共用一阶热惯性示意，无喷嘴风场、空间温度分布或实际返修配方。','This shares a first-order thermal illustration, without nozzle flow, spatial temperature fields or a real rework recipe.'],
 ['stencil-guide','能计算方形钢网开口的理论体积和面积比，并解释几何与工艺的差别。','Calculate square-aperture volume/area ratio and distinguish geometry from process quality.','设a=0.3mm、t=0.12mm，预测V=0.0108mm³、AR=0.625；只增大a到0.4mm，再比较结果。','Set a=0.3 mm and t=0.12 mm to predict V=0.0108 mm³ and AR=0.625, then increase only a to 0.4 mm and compare.','保持开口不变、钢网加厚，理论体积与面积比会一起增加吗？','At fixed aperture size, does increasing thickness increase both volume and area ratio?','不会。V=a²t随厚度增加，而AR=a/(4t)随厚度减小；真实脱模还受其他工艺因素影响。','No. V=a²t increases with thickness, while AR=a/(4t) decreases. Actual release also depends on process factors.','只计算理想方孔几何，未建模锡膏流变、刮印或真实缺陷概率。','This calculates ideal square-hole geometry, not paste rheology, printing or real defect probability.'],
 ['reflow-guide','能分清峰值、升降温速率与液相线上时间，并按给定窗口解释结果。','Distinguish peak, heating/cooling rates and TAL and interpret a specified window.','比较240°C/60s与240°C/20s，指出哪个课堂条件改变；再说明真实工艺窗口应从哪些材料与器件文件取得。','Compare 240°C/60 s with 240°C/20 s, identify the changed classroom criterion and state which documents define real limits.','TAL是否表示在最高温度保持的时间？','Does TAL mean time held at the maximum temperature?','不是。TAL是工件高于所用焊料液相线的总时间，峰值停留只是可能包含在其中的一部分。','No. TAL is total workpiece time above the solder’s liquidus; peak dwell is only a possible part of that interval.','225–245°C与40–70s仅为课堂假定；示意曲线不是实测炉温，不批准任何真实工艺。','225–245°C and 40–70 s are classroom assumptions. The illustration is not a measured oven profile or approval of a real process.']
].map(([id,gz,ge,pz,pe,qz,qe,az,ae,lz,le])=>[id,{goal:[gz,ge],practice:[pz,pe],question:[qz,qe],answer:[az,ae],labNote:[lz,le],labMode:'simulation'}])));
for(const id of ['adc','opamp','c-flow','cpp','python','boards','rtos','51','bus-physical','vision-ops','estimation','foc','bio','research'])LESSON_GUIDE7[id].labMode='concept';
const CHECK_EXPLANATIONS7={
 start:['先求电阻电压5−2=3V；I=3/330A≈0.00909A=9.09mA。2V是本例LED导通模型，不是任意LED的固定值。','The resistor has 5−2=3 V. I=3/330 A≈0.00909 A=9.09 mA. The 2 V LED drop belongs to this model, not every LED.'],
 kirchhoff:['串联总电阻1000+1000=2000Ω；I=5/2000A=0.0025A=2.5mA。中间没有分支，电流在两只电阻中相同。','Series resistance is 1000+1000=2000 Ω. I=5/2000 A=2.5 mA, equal in both resistors because the midpoint has no branch.'],
 components:['此题是独立电阻两端5V，没有串联LED。P=V²/R=25/100=0.25W；还需按实际温度与降额选择额定功率。','This question places 5 V across a resistor alone, with no series LED. P=V²/R=25/100=0.25 W. Choose a real rating using temperature and derating conditions.'],
 'wiring-guide':['闭合串联回路里，5V电源中有2V落在LED上，剩下3V在330Ω电阻上，所以I=3/330×1000≈9.09mA。','In the closed series loop, the LED drops 2 V of the 5 V supply, leaving 3 V across 330 Ω: I=3/330×1000≈9.09 mA.'],
 meter:['沿闭合回路使用电压守恒：5V=电阻压降+2V，因此电阻两端为3V。红笔接电阻高电位端、黑笔接低电位端读正3V；交换表笔读负值。','Voltage balance gives 5 V=resistor drop+2 V, so the resistor has 3 V. Red at its higher-potential end reads +3 V; reversed probes read negative.'],
 power:['限流5mA=0.005A，电阻压降IR=0.005×330=1.65V；再加本模型LED的2V，输出约3.65V，低于5V设定值。','A 5 mA limit is 0.005 A. Resistor drop is IR=1.65 V; add the modeled 2 V LED drop for about 3.65 V output, below the 5 V setting.'],
 rc:['10kΩ=10000Ω，100μF=0.0001F；τ=RC=10000×0.0001=1s。量纲Ω·F等于s。','10 kΩ=10000 Ω and 100 μF=0.0001 F. τ=RC=1 s; Ω·F has the dimension of seconds.'],
 scope:['1ms=0.001s；频率f=1/T=1/0.001=1000Hz。若直接把1ms当成1s，会差1000倍。','1 ms=0.001 s. Frequency f=1/T=1000 Hz. Treating milliseconds as seconds gives a thousand-fold error.'],
 logic:['8N1中的8是数据位数，N表示无校验，1是停止位；另加一个起始位，共1+8+1=10位。','In 8N1, eight is data bits, N means no parity and one is stop bits. Add one start bit: 1+8+1=10 bits.'],
 mcu:['1kHz=1000Hz；T=1/1000s=0.001s=1ms。频率增加时周期减小。','1 kHz=1000 Hz. T=1/1000 s=0.001 s=1 ms. Increasing frequency decreases period.'],
 'motor-control':['先换单位：ω=300×2π/60≈31.416rad/s；P=τω=0.5×31.416≈15.71W。这是轴端机械功率，电气输入还需考虑效率。','Convert first: ω=300×2π/60≈31.416 rad/s. P=τω≈15.71 W is shaft mechanical power; electrical input also depends on efficiency.'],
 robot:['两根杆同方向完全伸直时距离最大：110+110=220mm。这个几何上限尚未考虑真实关节限位、碰撞和工具长度。','Maximum distance occurs with both links aligned: 110+110=220 mm. This geometric bound does not include real joint limits, collisions or tool length.']
};
Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 kirchhoff:[
 ['先给节点起名字','Name the nodes first','把理想导线直接连通的点归为同一个节点。给电源正端叫A，两个电阻之间叫M，负端叫G。所有“电压”都写成A对G、M对G这样的两点关系。这样即使原理图画法改变，计算对象也不会改变。','Group points joined by ideal wire into one node. Call supply positive A, the resistor midpoint M and return G. Write voltages as A relative to G or M relative to G so the meaning survives a changed drawing.'],
 ['串联：同一条路，电流相同','Series: one path, equal current','两只电阻首尾相连，中间没有分支时，流过它们的电流相同。总电阻是R1+R2。两个1 kΩ接5 V时，总电阻2 kΩ，电流2.5 mA；每个电阻分到2.5 V。','Two resistors in one unbranched path carry the same current. Their total is R1+R2. Two 1 kΩ resistors on 5 V carry 2.5 mA and each drops 2.5 V.'],
 ['并联：共用两端，电压相同','Parallel: shared ends, equal voltage','两只电阻的两端分别接在同一对节点上，才是并联。每条支路都承受相同电压。两个1 kΩ并在5 V上，每路5 mA，总共10 mA，等效500 Ω。','Resistors are parallel when both ends connect to the same pair of nodes. Each 1 kΩ branch across 5 V carries 5 mA; together they draw 10 mA and are equivalent to 500 Ω.'],
 ['用守恒检查结果','Check your result with conservation','在中间节点检查流入与流出电流之和；沿回路检查电源升压与元件降压是否相抵。若计算得到两个串联电阻电流不同，先找漏掉的支路、单位或符号，不要急着改公式。','At a node, balance incoming and outgoing currents. Around a loop, balance source rise and component drops. Unequal currents in an unbranched series path indicate a missing branch or a unit/sign error.']
 ],
 components:[
 ['先读符号，再认实物','Read the symbol before the package','原理图符号告诉你电气功能，外壳尺寸不一定告诉你数值。先核对位号、参数、极性和引脚，再选择实物。外形相似的三脚器件可能有完全不同的引脚排列。','A schematic symbol tells electrical function; package size does not reliably reveal value. Check designator, value, polarity and pinout before selecting a physical part. Similar three-pin packages can have different pin orders.'],
 ['电阻的两个关键额定值','Two essential resistor ratings','阻值决定线性模型中的电流关系，额定功率决定允许的热负担。100 Ω两端5 V时，电流50 mA，功率0.25 W；这不意味着任意100 Ω电阻都适用，还要看额定条件和温升。','Resistance sets the current relation; power rating limits thermal loading. A 100 Ω resistor across 5 V carries 50 mA and dissipates 0.25 W. Check rating conditions and temperature before choosing a part.'],
 ['电容要检查容量和耐压','Check capacitance and voltage rating','容量表示储存电荷与电压的关系，耐压是不能忽略的工作边界。某些电容有极性，陶瓷电容的有效容量也可能随直流偏压变化。不要只按一个μF数值替换所有电容。','Capacitance relates charge to voltage; voltage rating is a separate limit. Some capacitors are polarized, and ceramic capacitance may change with DC bias. Matching the μF value alone is not enough.'],
 ['二极管和MOSFET不是电阻','Diodes and MOSFETs are not fixed resistors','LED有方向和非线性伏安关系；MOSFET的导通电阻依赖栅极驱动条件。课堂把LED简化成2 V压降是为了建立直觉，真实选型要查看曲线、最大额定值和热设计。','An LED is directional and nonlinear. MOSFET on-resistance depends on gate drive. The classroom LED model uses 2 V for intuition; actual selection requires curves, ratings and thermal checks.']
 ],
 'wiring-guide':[
 ['把电路写成连接表','Write a connection list','先写：电源正端接电阻一端；电阻另一端接LED阳极；LED阴极接电源负端。每写一条就指出它在图上的两个端点。连接表比凭“看起来差不多”接线更可靠。','Write: source positive to resistor; resistor to LED anode; LED cathode to source return. Point to the two endpoints for every connection rather than copying the drawing by appearance.'],
 ['认识面包板内部连接','Understand breadboard connections','面包板不是每个孔彼此独立，也不是相邻孔全相通。短排孔和长电源轨通常按组相连，有的电源轨在中间断开。断电时用连续性档确认结构，再放元件。','Breadboard holes are connected in groups. Short strips and supply rails follow a pattern, and some rails are split midway. Verify the pattern with continuity testing while unpowered.'],
 ['上电前检查四件事','Four checks before power','核对正负极、LED方向、电阻数值和是否存在直接短接电源的路径。确认后先用低压和合适限流。模拟里可以复位，真实烧坏的器件不能靠复位恢复。','Check polarity, LED orientation, resistor value and any direct short across the source. Start with appropriate low voltage and current limiting. Resetting a simulation does not imply damaged hardware can be reset.'],
 ['不亮时不要盲目加电压','Do not raise voltage blindly','依次检查电源是否开启、回路是否闭合、LED是否反接、元件是否插在同一内部连通组。测量节点电压可以缩小范围。先定位原因，再修改接线。','Check output enable, loop continuity, LED polarity and breadboard strip placement. Node-voltage measurements narrow the fault. Diagnose before changing wiring or increasing voltage.']
 ],
 power:[
 ['电压设定与电流限值不同','Voltage setting and current limit differ','电压设定是电源想维持的输出电压，限流是允许提供的电流上限。正常情况下负载决定实际电流，并不是把限流设成1 A就一定向任何负载灌入1 A。','The voltage setting is what the supply tries to maintain. The current limit is an upper bound. Normally the load determines current; a 1 A limit does not force 1 A through every load.'],
 ['恒压与恒流怎样切换','How CV becomes CC','负载在目标电压下需要的电流低于限值时，电源工作在恒压区；超过限值时，电源降低电压以限制电流。在这个LED操作台里，实际电流取电阻计算值与限流值中较小的一个。','Below the current limit, the supply operates in CV. When the requested current exceeds the limit, voltage falls. In this LED workbench, current is the smaller of the resistor prediction and the configured limit.'],
 ['用一个具体数字判断','Predict a concrete operating point','5 V、LED压降2 V、330 Ω时需要约9.09 mA。把限流调到5 mA，电阻压降变为1.65 V，输出约3.65 V。比较电压读数、LED和电流动画，它们应描述同一个状态。','At 5 V, a 2 V LED and 330 Ω request 9.09 mA. Limiting to 5 mA gives a 1.65 V resistor drop and about 3.65 V output. The voltage, LED and current animation should agree.'],
 ['给未知板卡上电前','Before powering an unfamiliar board','先确认额定输入、极性和接线；断电检查明显短路；设置合理电压和限流后再开启输出。若电压立刻掉下去，不要直接提高限流，要检查短路、启动浪涌和负载状态。','Verify rated input, polarity and wiring, then inspect for shorts unpowered. Set appropriate voltage and current limit before enabling output. If voltage collapses, investigate shorts, startup surge and load state before increasing the limit.']
 ],
 logic:[
 ['数字信号也有模拟电压','Digital signals still have analog voltages','逻辑1不是“任意非零电压”。接收器按输入阈值把电压判为高或低，阈值和允许范围要查具体器件。5 V输出直接接3.3 V器件可能超出允许范围。','A logic one is not just any nonzero voltage. The receiver uses thresholds and input limits from its specification. A 5 V output may exceed a 3.3 V device input rating.'],
 ['UART为什么需要起始位','Why UART needs a start bit','UART没有单独时钟线，所以接收方依靠从空闲高到起始低的变化确定一帧的开始。随后按约定波特率在各位中心附近采样。双方速率或帧格式不同，就可能读错。','Without a separate clock wire, UART uses the idle-high to start-low transition to locate the frame. The receiver samples near bit centers at the agreed rate. Rate or frame-format mismatch can corrupt data.'],
 ['手工发送一个A','Send one A by hand','字符A的常用ASCII值是65，也就是0x41，二进制01000001。书写时高位在左，但UART先发送D0，因此数据位依次为1、0、0、0、0、0、1、0，再加前面的起始0和后面的停止1。','ASCII A is decimal 65 or 0x41, written 01000001 in binary. UART sends D0 first, giving data bits 1,0,0,0,0,0,1,0, preceded by start 0 and followed by stop 1.'],
 ['把电气错误和协议错误分开','Separate electrical and protocol faults','先检查供电、参考地和电平，再核对波特率、数据位、校验和停止位。若仍不对，观察波形边沿与采样条件。不要只因为分析仪显示了一个字符就认为整个链路可靠。','Check power, reference ground and levels first, then baud rate, data bits, parity and stop bits. Next inspect edges and sampling conditions. One plausible decoded character does not establish link reliability.']
 ],
 mcu:[
 ['程序如何变成引脚动作','How software changes a pin','程序读写外设寄存器，外设再控制引脚电路。设置输出模式与写输出值是两件事；某些引脚还要先开启外设时钟。初学时先用已验证开发板，把软件与硬件边界分清。','Software accesses peripheral registers, and the peripheral controls pin circuitry. Configuring output mode and writing an output value are separate operations. Some peripherals also need their clock enabled.'],
 ['先做一个能测量的闪灯','Make blinking measurable','第一次实验只做LED闪烁。明确哪个引脚、有效高还是有效低、目标周期是多少。能看到闪烁后，用计时或波形确认周期，再把阻塞延时换成定时器。','For the first experiment, identify the LED pin, active level and target period. After observing blinking, measure its period, then replace a blocking delay with a timer-based design.'],
 ['输入不能一直悬空','Inputs need a defined state','没有外部驱动也没有上下拉时，输入电平可能不确定。按键实验中先明确默认状态，再连接按键；机械触点会抖动，因此一次按下可能产生多次边沿，需要消抖。','An undriven input without a pull resistor can be undefined. Define the default button state before wiring. Mechanical bounce can create multiple edges from one press, so debounce is needed.'],
 ['为什么要逐个外设学','Learn one peripheral at a time','依次学习GPIO、定时器、串口、ADC，再考虑中断和DMA。每加一层都保存一个能独立复验的例子。串口打印只是观测手段，不能替代时间要求严格的控制路径。','Learn GPIO, timers, serial I/O and ADC separately before combining interrupts and DMA. Preserve one reproducible example at each stage. Serial logging is an observation tool, not a replacement for time-critical control.']
 ],
 robot:[
 ['坐标必须带参考系','Coordinates need a reference frame','说“移动100mm”之前，要说明相对谁。这里基座是原点，X、Y描述机械臂所在的水平工作平面；从上往下看，可把X画向右、Y画向上。透视画面中的上下不等于坐标轴方向，目标读数仍以基座坐标与mm为准。','Specify a reference before saying move 100 mm. Here the base is the origin and X/Y describe the horizontal workspace. In a plan view, X can point right and Y up. Screen directions in perspective do not define the axes; target values remain base-frame millimeters.'],
 ['先从关节角算末端','Start with forward kinematics','第一根杆角度为θ1，第二根相对第一根转θ2，因此第二根在世界坐标里的方向是θ1+θ2。分别计算两根杆在X、Y上的投影再相加。不能把第二根只按θ2对地投影。','The second link direction in the base frame is θ1+θ2 because θ2 is relative to the first link. Add the X and Y projections of both links. Do not treat θ2 alone as its world angle.'],
 ['逆解为什么可能不存在','Why an inverse solution may not exist','两根110 mm杆完全伸直时最远220 mm。目标距离超过220 mm，没有任何关节角能到达。实际机械臂还可能有最小距离、关节限位和碰撞限制。本例只验证平面两杆几何。','Two 110 mm links reach at most 220 mm. A farther target has no joint solution. Real arms also have minimum reach, joint limits and collision constraints; this model only checks planar geometry.'],
 ['关节平滑不代表末端直线','Smooth joints do not guarantee a straight end-point path','拖动目标后，本例让关节逐渐接近逆解。两个角度同时变化，末端通常会走曲线。若要末端走直线，需要在任务空间规划中间点，再逐点求解并检查速度、加速度和碰撞。','This model smoothly approaches the target joint angles, so the end point generally follows a curve. Straight task-space motion requires intermediate target planning plus velocity, acceleration and collision checks.']
 ]});
DEEP_LESSONS.meter.push(
 ['旋钮档位和表笔插孔是两件事','The selector and the lead jack do different jobs','旋钮选择仪表要测的物理量与量程；插孔决定红表笔接入仪表的哪条内部电路。测直流电压选择 V⎓，红笔接 VΩ、黑笔接 COM。屏幕显示电压，不会因为把红笔插进 mA 孔就自动变成电流表。','The selector chooses the quantity and range; the jack routes the red lead through an internal circuit. For DC voltage, choose V⎓, red in VΩ and black in COM. A jack change does not automatically turn a voltage mode into an ammeter.'],
 ['先估范围，再选手动量程','Estimate first, then choose a manual range','手动量程要选“高于预计值的最小一档”，避免低量程过载显示 OL。若预计约5 V，可从20 V档开始；读数稳定后再按仪表分辨率需要调整。自动量程会自行切换，但反应可能较慢。实际档位上限以具体表的面板与说明书为准。','Choose the smallest manual range above the expected value to avoid overrange OL. For an expected 5 V, start at 20 V, then adjust for resolution if needed. Autorange changes ranges itself but may respond more slowly. Confirm the actual meter limits on its face and manual.'],
 ['mA和10A端子不能互换着试','The mA and 10 A jacks are not interchangeable test points','先判断电流大约多大并查仪表额定值。较小电流走 mA 端，超出 mA 端额定值时才考虑 10A 端和对应量程；10A 端的分辨率、熔断保护和允许测量时间因仪表而异。不能为了“试试看”把电流档直接跨接电源。','Estimate current and check the meter rating. Use the mA jack for currents within its limit; consider the 10 A jack and range only when needed. Resolution, fuse protection and allowed measurement time vary by meter. Never bridge a source with a current input to experiment.'],
 ['按断电、接线、上电的顺序测电流','Measure current in a power-off, rewire, power-on sequence','先关闭电源，再把待测支路断开；黑笔留在 COM，红笔按预估电流插入 mA 或 10A，并把旋钮置于 A⎓。让支路电流从红表笔进入、从黑表笔流出后再上电读取。结束后先断电、移除仪表并把红笔插回 VΩ。','Turn power off and open the branch. Keep black in COM; place red in mA or 10 A for the expected current and select A⎓. Insert the meter so branch current enters red and leaves black, then power on and read. Power off again, remove the meter and return red to VΩ.']
);

Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 'c-flow':[
 ['让输入、状态和输出各有名字','Name input, state and output','以按键控制LED为例：输入是引脚电平，状态是“未按、确认中、已按”，输出是LED开关。先用自然语言写出每种情况，再选择变量与判断语句。把状态变化和引脚读写混在一起，会很难复查故障优先级。','For a button-controlled LED, input is a pin level, state can be released, debouncing or pressed, and output is the LED command. Describe each case before choosing variables and conditionals. Keeping state transitions distinct from I/O makes fault priority easier to review.'],
 ['类型决定允许表示什么','Types define representable values','8位无符号数只能表示0到255；把更大的结果存入其中会丢失高位。C的有符号整数溢出没有可依赖的通用结果。计算前检查类型、符号和单位，尤其不要把毫秒、秒、计数和角度混进同一个无说明变量。','An eight-bit unsigned value represents 0 through 255; storing a larger result loses high-order information. Signed integer overflow in C has no portable result to rely on. Check type, sign and units before arithmetic, especially for milliseconds, seconds, counts and angles.'],
 ['用状态机表达允许的转换','Express allowed transitions with a state machine','IDLE收到启动事件才能进入RUN；RUN收到停止或故障事件退出；FAULT只有在故障已消除且满足明确复位条件后才允许离开。为未知状态定义默认安全输出。状态机的价值是让遗漏分支变得可见。','IDLE enters RUN on an allowed start event; RUN exits on stop or fault; FAULT exits only after the fault clears and an explicit reset condition is met. Define a safe default for unexpected states. A state machine makes missing transitions easier to see.'],
 ['定时不必阻塞整个程序','Timing need not block the program','若每次等待500ms都停止执行，按键、通信和故障处理也可能被延后。让主循环反复检查时间戳，到期只完成一次短动作，再继续处理其他输入。实现时要考虑计数器回绕和时间类型；课堂CPU单步用于理解顺序，不会编译C程序。','A blocking 500 ms wait can postpone button, communication and fault handling. Let the loop check timestamps, perform one short action when due, then handle other inputs. Account for timer wrap and time types. The classroom CPU stepper illustrates sequence; it does not compile C.']
 ],
 cpp:[
 ['对象把状态和操作放在一起','Objects connect state with operations','一个串口对象可以保存缓冲区、配置和错误状态，并提供读写接口。调用者只需遵守接口约定，不必知道寄存器细节。构造后应该满足哪些条件、关闭后还能否使用，都要通过接口清楚表达。','A serial-port object can hold buffers, configuration and error state while exposing read and write operations. Callers follow the interface without depending on register details. Make valid post-construction conditions and permitted operations after closing explicit.'],
 ['RAII让释放跟着生命周期走','RAII ties release to lifetime','资源可以是内存、文件、锁或外设句柄。用对象持有资源，正常离开作用域和提前返回时由析构释放，减少每条分支手写清理的遗漏。中断上下文、退出方式和异常配置仍需遵守目标系统限制。','A resource may be memory, a file, a lock or a device handle. An owning object releases it when its lifetime ends, including normal scope exit and early return. This reduces duplicated cleanup, while interrupt context, termination behavior and exception settings still follow target-system constraints.'],
 ['所有权和借用要能看出来','Make ownership and borrowing visible','一个缓冲区可以由容器独占，再把有明确长度的只读视图传给算法。借用方不能在拥有者销毁后继续访问。共享所有权只用于确实需要多个拥有者的场景，循环引用和线程同步仍要另外处理。','A container can own a buffer and pass a bounded read-only view to an algorithm. Borrowers must not outlive the owner. Shared ownership belongs where multiple owners are actually needed; cycles and thread synchronization still need separate handling.'],
 ['在实时路径里量化成本','Measure costs in the real-time path','比较静态缓冲和动态分配时，要记录峰值内存、最坏执行时间、碎片与失败处理。模板和容器可以改善表达，但不会自动保证小代码或固定延迟。先做可测的最小接口，再决定允许哪些语言特性进入实时环。','When comparing static buffers with dynamic allocation, measure peak memory, worst-case time, fragmentation and failure handling. Templates and containers can improve expression but do not guarantee compact code or fixed latency. Use a measurable minimal interface to choose features for the real-time loop.']
 ],
 python:[
 ['让一份数据从输入走到输出','Follow one dataset from input to output','一个可靠脚本应说明读哪个文件、每列的含义和单位、如何处理缺失值、输出到哪里。先用三行手工可核对的数据运行，再换成完整日志。时间列以秒还是毫秒保存，会直接影响频率和速度计算。','A reliable script states its input file, column meaning and units, missing-value policy and output destination. Begin with three hand-checkable rows, then use the full log. Seconds versus milliseconds directly changes frequency and velocity calculations.'],
 ['用独立环境保存项目依赖','Keep project dependencies in an isolated environment','虚拟环境隔离项目使用的包，不会复制所有系统软件或替你安装设备驱动。记录Python版本、依赖版本和运行命令；复现时从这些记录重建。配置中的本机路径和凭据要与可发布代码分开保存。','A virtual environment isolates project packages; it does not duplicate all system software or install device drivers. Record Python and dependency versions plus the run command so the environment can be recreated. Keep local paths and credentials separate from distributable code.'],
 ['数组形状、类型和单位都要检查','Check array shape, type and units','图像、传感器批次和时间序列常用数组。uint8图像直接相减可能产生回绕，应在需要负差值时先转换合适类型。计算一列数据前，确认选择的是电压列而不是时间列，确认运算是否复制或修改了原数组。','Arrays hold images, sensor batches and time series. Subtracting unsigned eight-bit images can wrap; convert to a suitable type when negative differences matter. Before processing a column, confirm its meaning and whether the operation copies or modifies the original array.'],
 ['用有解释的错误保留证据','Keep evidence when errors occur','捕获能够处理的异常，并在错误信息中指出文件或字段；不要把所有异常吞掉后写出一份看似成功的结果。原始数据只读保留，清洗后的数据另存，图表标单位、处理参数和样本数。','Catch errors you can handle and identify the file or field involved. Do not swallow every exception and emit a success-looking result. Preserve raw data, save cleaned data separately, and label plots with units, processing parameters and sample count.']
 ],
 'cpu-arch':[
 ['跟着PC走一遍程序','Follow the program counter','CPU取指、解释指令，再更新寄存器、内存或程序位置。课堂PC用“指令序号”表示下一条位置，真实CPU通常使用指令地址；两者的单位不同。先预测下一条指令，再按单步按钮，核对实际变化。','The CPU fetches and interprets an instruction, then changes registers, memory or control flow. This teaching PC is an instruction index, while real CPUs normally use an instruction address. Predict the next instruction before stepping and compare the resulting state.'],
 ['用累加1到5连接寄存器与内存','Connect registers and memory with a sum','计数从5开始，和从0开始。每轮把计数加到和里，再减1并检查是否为零，最后把15写到内存地址0。寄存器保存正在计算的状态，STORE让结果进入内存；结束后不要只看动画，要核对寄存器与内存。','Start the counter at five and the sum at zero. Add the counter, decrement it and check for zero each iteration, then store 15 at memory address zero. Registers hold working state; STORE writes the result to memory. Check actual values at completion.'],
 ['同样的位串可以有不同解释','One bit pattern can mean different values','8位11111111按无符号解释为255，按二进制补码有符号解释为−1。类型、指令和位宽决定解释方式。十六进制只是更紧凑的写法，每位代表4比特；0xA5仍是同一串10100101。','The eight bits 11111111 mean 255 as unsigned or −1 as a two’s-complement signed value. Type, instruction and width determine the interpretation. Hexadecimal is compact notation, four bits per digit; 0xA5 remains the bit pattern 10100101.'],
 ['真实启动还有一层运行环境','Real startup prepares an execution environment','真实MCU复位后要按架构读取复位入口、初始化栈和存储区，再进入应用。中断需要保存和恢复相应上下文，链接配置决定代码与数据放在哪里。本页有限指令集用于观察这些概念的基础，不生成真实ARM或RISC-V固件。','After reset, a real MCU follows its architecture’s reset entry and initializes stack and storage before the application. Interrupts preserve required context, and linking determines code and data locations. This finite teaching ISA illustrates foundations; it does not generate ARM or RISC-V firmware.']
 ],
 '51':[
 ['8051兼容不代表外围完全相同','8051 compatibility does not fix every peripheral','先查芯片完整型号、供电、时钟、引脚和编程方式。经典12T内核的机器周期与一些现代1T兼容芯片不同，相同晶振和同一段延时循环未必得到同样时间。把数据手册上的时钟路径画出来再计算。','Check the full part number, supply, clock, pins and programming method. Classic 12T timing differs from some modern 1T-compatible devices, so the same crystal and delay loop may produce different timing. Draw the documented clock path before calculating.'],
 ['用定时器产生可核对的节拍','Generate a checkable timer tick','假定某定时器每1μs加1，要等待1ms就需1000个计数。若是16位向上溢出计数，理想预装值为65536−1000=64536；是否自动重装、何时装载与中断延迟还取决于具体外设模式。','If a timer increments every 1 μs, 1 ms requires 1000 counts. For an ideal 16-bit upward overflow timer, preload is 65536−1000=64536. Auto-reload behavior, load timing and interrupt delay depend on the actual peripheral mode.'],
 ['扫描显示与按键要共享时间','Schedule display and key scanning','数码管复用一次只选择某一位，并按规定段电流驱动；亮度与占空比和峰值电流共同相关。矩阵键盘按行列扫描，需要处理按键抖动和可能的多键鬼影。用短周期调度多个动作，比很长的忙等待更容易保证串口接收。','A multiplexed display selects digits in turn within segment-current limits; brightness depends on duty cycle and peak current. Matrix-key scanning needs debounce and may need ghost-key handling. Short scheduled actions leave more opportunity for serial reception than long busy waits.'],
 ['把外部扩展看成独立接口','Treat expansion as a separate interface','没有内置ADC的型号需要外部ADC，并不意味着所有51都要外接。扩展器件还涉及总线、电平、参考电压和时序。先用固定数据测试通信，再接传感器，这样才能区分通信故障与测量问题。','A part without an internal ADC needs an external one, but not every 8051 derivative lacks an ADC. Expansion adds bus, voltage-level, reference and timing requirements. Test communication with known data before adding a sensor to separate link faults from measurement errors.']
 ],
 arduino:[
 ['把板型、核心和库分开','Separate board, core and library','板型选择决定目标芯片与上传方式，核心提供该平台API的实现，库封装某个功能或器件。遇到示例不能编译时，先检查它适用的核心和版本；遇到能编译但不工作时，再核对引脚、地址和硬件。','Board selection determines target and upload settings; the core implements platform APIs; a library packages a function or device. For compilation failures, check supported core and version. For code that compiles but fails in use, inspect pins, addresses and hardware.'],
 ['第一个程序要能解释每个动作','Explain every action in the first sketch','setup做一次初始化，loop持续执行。LED亮灭前要确认引脚是否需要输出配置、板上LED是高电平还是低电平点亮、板上是否已有电阻。外接LED要按电源与LED压降计算限流，不能照抄未知板的引脚编号。','Setup initializes once and loop repeats. Before blinking, confirm output configuration, active-high or active-low behavior, and any onboard resistor. An external LED needs current limiting chosen for its supply and forward drop; do not copy an unknown board’s pin number.'],
 ['analogWrite的名称不能替代硬件知识','An API name does not define its hardware','许多Arduino平台上的analogWrite生成PWM，不是连续模拟电压；部分具备DAC的板在指定引脚可输出DAC值。可用引脚、分辨率与频率依核心而异。analogRead同样要核对参考电压、输入上限和码值范围。','On many Arduino platforms, analogWrite produces PWM rather than a continuous analog voltage; some DAC-equipped boards support DAC output on specific pins. Pins, resolution and frequency depend on the core. Check reference, input limits and code range for analogRead too.'],
 ['分清编译、上传和运行验证','Separate compilation, upload and behavior','编译通过表示代码生成了目标程序，上传通过表示工具完成了传输过程。真正验证还包括正确上电、引脚行为、串口数据和复位后能否恢复。记录板型、核心与库版本，让别人能用相同条件重做最小示例。','Compilation produces a target program; successful upload reports a transfer. Verification also checks power-up, pin behavior, serial data and recovery after reset. Record board, core and library versions so someone else can repeat the minimal example.']
 ],
 'esp-net':[
 ['网络不是固定延迟导线','A network is not a fixed-delay wire','无线控制可能延迟、断开或重连，网络任务不应承担毫秒级电机电流环。把本地控制与上层命令分开，接收端记录命令年龄、序号与有效性。重新连接时先核对状态，再接受恢复动作。','Wireless commands may be delayed, disconnected or retried; networking should not carry a millisecond motor-current loop. Separate local control from supervisory commands and track command age, sequence and validity. Reconcile state after reconnecting before allowing resumed action.'],
 ['字节流需要应用自己划分消息','A byte stream needs message framing','TCP保证连接内可靠有序的字节流，但一次读取可能只有半条消息，也可能含多条消息。可用长度字段或明确分隔符实现帧边界，并检查长度上限。UDP保留数据报边界，但丢失、重复和乱序要由应用按需求处理。','TCP provides an ordered reliable byte stream within a connection, but one read may contain part of a message or several messages. Use length fields or delimiters and enforce size limits. UDP preserves datagrams, while loss, duplicates and reordering need application policy.'],
 ['OTA要设计启动确认与回退','Design OTA confirmation and rollback','应用OTA通常先写未运行的分区，核对完整性与来源后切换启动。新版本首次启动要自检，再确认有效或请求回退；是否启用这些机制需查具体SDK配置。校验和能发现意外损坏，不能单独证明固件来自可信发布者。','Application OTA typically writes an inactive slot, verifies integrity and origin, then changes boot selection. The new application needs a first-boot check and acceptance or rollback policy according to SDK configuration. A checksum detects accidental corruption but does not alone authenticate the publisher.'],
 ['低功耗要把唤醒和峰值算进去','Budget wake-up and peak power','平均电流可按各状态电流乘持续时间后求平均，但稳压器还要承受无线瞬时峰值。记录休眠状态保留了哪些数据、唤醒要多久、断网时重试多少次。无限重试可能让名义低功耗设备长期保持高耗电。','Average current can be estimated from current and duration in each state, while the regulator must still withstand radio peaks. Record retained state, wake latency and retry policy. Unlimited retries can keep a nominal low-power device at high consumption.']
 ],
 'bus-physical':[
 ['差分接收器比较两根线','A differential receiver compares two wires','差分传输主要根据两线电压差判定符号，可抑制一定共模干扰，但接收器仍有允许的共模范围。连接器里的参考地、屏蔽、隔离和保护要按系统设计，不能因有两根差分线就认为不再存在接地问题。','A differential receiver interprets the voltage difference between two wires and rejects some common-mode interference, but still has common-mode limits. Reference, shielding, isolation and protection remain system-level requirements. Two differential wires do not eliminate grounding concerns.'],
 ['终端是为了匹配传播路径','Termination matches the transmission path','电缆上的快速边沿按传输线传播，阻抗突变会产生反射。需要两端终端的线形总线，应在物理两端按规范布置，不是在每个节点都加一个。支线、长度和边沿速度影响信号，不能只用波特率猜是否需要终端。','Fast edges propagate along a cable as a transmission line; impedance changes produce reflections. A linear bus requiring end termination uses the specified termination at its physical ends, not at every node. Stubs, length and edge speed affect the result, not baud rate alone.'],
 ['RS-485收发器与协议分层','Separate an RS-485 transceiver from the protocol','UART发出的逻辑位可交给RS-485收发器转换成差分电气信号。半双工时发送使能必须及时释放，避免两个节点同时驱动。Modbus RTU在此之上规定帧与字段；A/B命名存在设备差异，接线应以各方手册定义为准。','A transceiver converts UART logic into RS-485 electrical signaling. A half-duplex transmitter must release drive appropriately to avoid contention. Modbus RTU adds frame and field rules above that interface. A/B naming differs between equipment, so compare the actual pin definitions.'],
 ['从断电检查走向波形检查','Progress from unpowered checks to waveforms','先核对连线、拓扑和终端，再确认供电、电气范围与位时序。若两端各有120Ω终端且没有其他显著并联路径，断电时跨差分线可测到约60Ω；它只支持一个连接判断，不证明运行时无反射或通信可靠。','Check wiring, topology and termination before supply, electrical limits and bit timing. With two 120 Ω end resistors and no significant other parallel paths, an unpowered bus measures about 60 Ω across the pair. This supports a connection check, not proof of reflection-free or reliable operation.']
 ],
 'rc-link':[
 ['脉宽、周期和数据帧是不同量','Distinguish pulse width, period and frames','脉宽控制看一次高电平持续多久，PWM占空比看高电平占周期的比例，数字协议按位与字段编码命令。即使都出现方波，含义也可能完全不同。先记录接收器或电调支持的协议、电平、反相和时序。','Pulse-width commands use high-pulse duration, duty cycle is the high fraction of a period, and digital protocols encode commands in bits and fields. Similar-looking square waves can mean different things. Record supported protocol, levels, inversion and timing first.'],
 ['先验证命令如何对应动作','Check how a command maps to an action','同一数值在不同模式可能表示油门、位置、速度或转矩，零值也不一定等于停机。把最小值、中位值、最大值、方向和解锁条件写成接口表，在无危险输出条件下观察接收与解释结果，再逐步进入受控台架。','The same number may represent throttle, position, speed or torque, and zero may not mean stop. Document minimum, center, maximum, direction and arming conditions. Observe reception and interpretation with hazardous output disabled before progressing to a controlled test rig.'],
 ['失联由消息年龄判断','Detect stale commands from their age','若期望50Hz更新，正常间隔约20ms。可以用课堂示例比较消息持续更新与超过100ms未更新时的行为，但真实超时必须依据运动风险、通信抖动和停车时间设计。收到旧命令的重发不应当作新的操作者意图。','At an expected 50 Hz update rate, the normal interval is about 20 ms. A classroom example can compare regular updates with a 100 ms gap, but a real timeout depends on motion risk, jitter and stopping time. Replayed stale commands are not fresh operator intent.'],
 ['把失效响应验证到执行端','Verify failure response at the actuator side','发送端显示断开不代表执行器已停止。测试计划要同时记录接收端超时、驱动器输出和实际运动状态，并定义恢复条件。飞行电调台架先拆桨，所有机构先建立可到达的断电和限能措施。课堂消息动画只说明逻辑，不构成实机通过证明。','A disconnected transmitter display does not prove the actuator has stopped. Record receiver timeout, driver output and actual motion, with explicit recovery conditions. Remove propellers for ESC bench work and provide reachable isolation and energy limits. Classroom message animation demonstrates logic, not hardware acceptance.']
 ]
});

Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 pcb:[
 ['把电气意图落实到网络与封装','Connect electrical intent to nets and footprints','原理图中的引脚编号必须对应封装焊盘，网络名决定电气连接。连接器从正面还是背面看的图也可能不同。先核对每个关键器件的引脚、极性和尺寸，再讨论摆放是否漂亮；错误封装无法靠布线补救。','Schematic pin numbers must map to footprint pads, and net names define connections. Connector drawings can use different viewing directions. Verify critical pinouts, polarity and dimensions before optimizing placement; routing cannot repair the wrong footprint.'],
 ['把去路和回路一起布局','Place forward and return paths together','高速信号和开关电源的回流路径影响噪声与辐射。让去耦、电源开关回路、晶振和敏感模拟路径各有合理位置，避免随意跨越回流中断区域。仅把信号线画得短，还不足以说明完整回路良好。','Return paths influence noise and emissions from fast signals and switching supplies. Place decoupling, switching loops, crystals and sensitive analog paths deliberately, avoiding unintended return discontinuities. A short signal trace alone does not establish a good complete current loop.'],
 ['线宽检查只是规则的一部分','Trace width is one part of the rule set','本平台只比较示例最小线宽和间距，不计算全板连通、阻抗、载流、温升或制造良率。实际规则还受铜厚、叠层、板厂能力、电压和工作环境影响。通过0.2mm示例规则，不能推出任意电流都能通过。','The platform checks illustrative minimum width and spacing, not whole-board connectivity, impedance, current capacity, heating or yield. Real rules depend on copper thickness, stack-up, fabrication, voltage and environment. Passing a 0.2 mm example does not establish a current rating.'],
 ['从制造输出走到首次上电','Move from fabrication outputs to first power-up','制造前核对Gerber层、钻孔、板框、BOM、贴片坐标和版本一致。装配后先检查极性、桥连与电源阻值，再限流分段上电，逐条验证电源轨、时钟、复位和通信。保存测试点与期望值，下一块板才能复验。','Before fabrication, check layer, drill, outline, BOM, placement and revision consistency. After assembly inspect polarity, bridges and supply resistance, then power stages with current limiting and verify rails, clocks, reset and communication. Preserve test points and expected values for the next board.']
 ],
 ml:[
 ['先规定模型到底要预测什么','Define the prediction target first','监督学习需要输入与标签，强化学习需要状态、动作和奖励。先定义任务与错误代价，再决定算法。把样本按独立对象、时间段或场景分开，避免同一次采集的近重复数据同时出现在训练与测试里。','Supervised learning needs inputs and labels; reinforcement learning needs states, actions and rewards. Define the task and cost of errors before the algorithm. Split by independent objects, time periods or scenes to keep near-duplicate captures out of both training and test sets.'],
 ['区分训练进展与泛化能力','Distinguish training progress from generalization','训练集用于更新参数，验证集用于选超参数与模型，测试集在这些选择结束后用于独立评估。训练误差不断下降而验证误差上升，可能是过拟合。重复看测试结果并据此调参，会让测试集失去独立性。','Training data updates parameters, validation data guides model choices, and a held-out test set evaluates the final choice. Falling training error with rising validation error can indicate overfitting. Repeated tuning against test results removes the test set’s independence.'],
 ['亲手算一次Q值更新','Calculate one Q-value update','Q-learning用Q←Q+α[r+γmaxQnext−Q]。若Q=0、α=0.2、r=1、γ=0.9、下一状态最大Q=2，新值为0.56。若这一步进入真正终止状态，后续价值应取0，不能继续使用2。','Q-learning uses Q←Q+α[r+γmaxQnext−Q]. With Q=0, α=0.2, r=1, γ=0.9 and maxQnext=2, the update gives 0.56. At a true terminal state the future term is zero, so it must not continue using two.'],
 ['同时看学习曲线和实际行为','Inspect both learning curves and behavior','固定随机种子便于对照两次实验，却不意味着结果对所有随机性都稳定。记录训练回合数、探索率与奖励定义，再检查策略是否绕开障碍、是否陷入循环。真实机器人迁移还需重新验证模型误差、延迟和保护。','A fixed seed makes comparisons reproducible, not universally robust. Record episodes, exploration and rewards, then inspect whether the learned policy avoids obstacles or loops. Transfer to a real robot requires separate validation of model error, delay and protection.']
 ],
 'linux-ros':[
 ['先建立进程和数据的对应关系','Map processes to data responsibilities','Linux进程负责执行程序，ROS节点是通信和计算的逻辑参与者，一个进程也可能承载多个节点。先写清谁产生数据、谁消费数据、时间戳从哪里来。网络能ping通，只能支持连通判断，不能证明节点和消息类型已正确匹配。','A Linux process executes code; a ROS node is a logical communication and computation participant, and one process may host several nodes. Identify producers, consumers and timestamp origins. Ping connectivity alone does not establish matching nodes or message types.'],
 ['按交互方式选择话题、服务和动作','Choose topics, services or actions by interaction','连续传感数据适合话题，短请求与响应适合服务，持续较久且需要进度反馈、取消的目标适合动作。参数用于配置。选接口时同时说明类型、单位、频率、超时和错误处理，不能只列一个名称。','Topics suit continuous data, services suit short request-response interactions, and actions suit longer goals needing feedback or cancellation. Parameters configure behavior. Specify type, units, rate, timeout and error handling along with the interface name.'],
 ['模型文件与TF发布有明确分工','Model files and TF publication have distinct roles','URDF描述连杆与关节，Xacro生成可复用描述；robot_state_publisher读取模型与关节状态后发布变换。TF用时间戳描述坐标系之间的关系。模型加载正确、关节角更新和坐标系单位正确，是三项需要分别验证的事情。','URDF describes links and joints; Xacro generates reusable descriptions. Robot State Publisher uses the model and joint states to publish transforms. TF describes frame relations over time. Loading the model, updating joints and using correct frame units require separate checks.'],
 ['从消息流检查系统健康','Check system health through message flow','逐项核对消息类型、频率、时间戳、QoS兼容性和命令年龄。可靠传输不能把很旧的数据变成实时数据；队列过深也可能增加延迟。本平台的ROS操作台运行本地消息流程模型，不安装ROS、不发现网络节点，也不驱动实体机器人。','Check message type, rate, timestamps, QoS compatibility and command age. Reliable transport does not make stale data current, and deep queues may add latency. The ROS workbench is a local message-flow model; it does not install ROS, discover network nodes or control hardware.']
 ],
 'vision-ops':[
 ['把处理管线拆成可比较的阶段','Split the image pipeline into comparable stages','从固定原图出发，分别保存灰度、滤波、阈值和形态学结果。每次只改一个参数，并观察小目标、边缘和噪点发生什么变化。若直接连用许多操作，最终变好或变坏的原因会难以追踪。','Start from one fixed image and preserve grayscale, filtering, threshold and morphology stages. Change one parameter and inspect small targets, edges and noise. Applying many operations at once makes the cause of improvement or degradation harder to identify.'],
 ['开闭运算依赖结构元素尺度','Morphology depends on structuring-element scale','在普通二值集合解释下，腐蚀收缩前景，膨胀扩张前景；开运算先腐蚀后膨胀，闭运算顺序相反。一个比目标更大的结构元素可能把目标一起删掉。边界处理与核形状也会影响结果。','In the usual binary-set interpretation, erosion shrinks foreground and dilation expands it. Opening erodes then dilates; closing reverses the order. A structuring element larger than the target may remove the target itself. Kernel shape and border handling also matter.'],
 ['轮廓面积不自动等于实物面积','Contour area is not automatically physical area','连通域把相邻前景像素分组，轮廓表示边界。像素面积换成mm²需要已知成像尺度或平面几何；目标离相机更远时，相同实物可能占更少像素。先限定测量平面与相机位置，再计算物理尺寸。','Connected components group neighboring foreground pixels and contours represent boundaries. Converting pixel area to mm² needs known imaging scale or planar geometry. The same object covers fewer pixels when farther away; define measurement plane and camera pose first.'],
 ['标定需要覆盖变化并保留检验图','Calibrate across varied views and keep checks','采集不同位置与角度的标定图，确保能稳定检测角点且覆盖工作区域。标定估计内参与畸变，外参描述相机与目标坐标关系。检查重投影误差和独立实物尺寸，不能只因为程序返回一个矩阵就认为测量准确。','Use calibration views spanning positions and orientations with reliable features across the working area. Intrinsics and distortion describe the camera, while extrinsics relate frames. Check reprojection error and independent dimensions; a returned matrix alone does not establish measurement accuracy.']
 ],
 estimation:[
 ['把隐藏状态和观测分开','Separate hidden state from observation','机器人位置、速度或零偏可能无法直接测得；传感器只提供某些相关观测。状态模型预测它们怎样变化，观测模型说明传感器会看到什么。先写状态、单位与时间步，再讨论滤波器名称。','Position, velocity or bias may not be directly measurable. A state model predicts their evolution, and an observation model describes what sensors see. Define state, units and time step before choosing a named filter.'],
 ['用一维例子理解加权修正','Understand correction with a scalar example','预测值10、预测误差方差P=4，测量值14、测量噪声方差R=1时，K=P/(P+R)=0.8。更新为10+0.8×(14−10)=13.2，更新方差为(1−K)P=0.8。这里假设直接观测、独立零均值误差和匹配的一维模型。','With prediction 10, prediction-error variance P=4, measurement 14 and noise variance R=1, K=P/(P+R)=0.8. The update is 13.2 and posterior variance is (1−K)P=0.8. This assumes a scalar direct observation with independent zero-mean errors and a matching model.'],
 ['协方差不是随意的平滑旋钮','Covariance is more than a smoothing knob','增大R会降低对当前测量的信任，增大过程噪声会让模型预测的不确定性增长更快。数值要结合传感器统计和模型误差解释。若系统存在固定偏差，只把曲线调得更平滑可能会掩盖问题。','Increasing R reduces trust in the current measurement; greater process noise grows prediction uncertainty faster. Relate values to sensor statistics and model error. Making a biased estimate smoother can hide the problem instead of correcting it.'],
 ['用创新与独立参考寻找失配','Use residuals and an independent reference','创新是测量减去预测观测。长期偏向一侧、时间错位或突然跳变，提示偏置、模型或时间同步问题。有些状态没有足够观测就不可辨识。课堂PID曲线可帮助认识动态误差，却不是完整卡尔曼滤波仿真。','Innovation is measurement minus predicted observation. Persistent offset, timing shifts or jumps can reveal bias, model error or synchronization problems. Some states are unobservable without sufficient information. The PID workbench illustrates dynamic error, not a complete Kalman-filter simulation.']
 ],
 foc:[
 ['从三相电流走到旋转坐标','Move from phase currents to rotating coordinates','FOC先把相电流表示到静止αβ平面，再按电角度转到dq坐标。选择合适参考系后，与磁链和转矩有关的电流分量更便于控制。坐标变换约定、缩放和符号必须整条链一致，不能混用不同教程的公式。','FOC maps phase currents into a stationary αβ plane, then rotates by electrical angle into dq coordinates. This can make flux-related and torque-related components easier to control. Transform conventions, scaling and signs must remain consistent throughout the chain.'],
 ['电角度与机械角度相差极对数','Electrical angle depends on pole pairs','若电机有7对极，在约定方向下机械角变化10°对应电角变化70°，还要加编码器与磁极之间的校准偏移。角度方向或极对数错误会让控制器在错误坐标系里施加电压，不能通过单纯调大增益补救。','With seven pole pairs, a 10° mechanical change corresponds to 70° electrical in the chosen direction, plus the calibrated sensor-to-pole offset. Wrong direction or pole-pair count makes the controller apply voltage in the wrong frame; increasing gains cannot repair it.'],
 ['电流采样要跟PWM配合','Coordinate current sampling with PWM','开关瞬态、死区、采样电阻和放大器建立时间都会影响电流读数。采样、角度获取、计算和PWM更新形成有时延的链。控制频率、限压、限流和抗饱和要一起设计，不是把单个PI公式复制三次就完成FOC。','Switching transients, dead time, shunts and amplifier settling affect current readings. Sampling, angle acquisition, computation and PWM update form a delayed chain. Design control rate, voltage/current limits and anti-windup together rather than merely copying one PI equation.'],
 ['先验证测量与符号，再调闭环','Verify measurements and signs before tuning','真实调试先依厂商平台确认供电、偏置、相序、角度、硬件保护和受控状态，再逐步验证电流环。本平台提供的是反馈控制基础和二维机构示意，未求解三相逆变器、电磁饱和或电机热模型，不能据此给出实机FOC参数。','Real commissioning starts with the vendor platform’s power, offsets, phase order, angle, hardware protection and controlled state, then validates current control. This platform teaches feedback foundations and planar motion; it does not solve an inverter, magnetic saturation or motor thermal model to produce hardware FOC gains.']
 ]
});

Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 bio:[
 ['从记录对象认识生物信号','Identify the source of the recorded signal','EEG、EMG和ECG分别研究不同生理来源的电活动，电极位置、采集条件和伪迹也不同。课堂先用公开或合成数据认识时间序列，不通过普通开发板和接地仪器直接连接人体。先理解数据来源，再讨论算法。','EEG, EMG and ECG concern different physiological sources, electrode arrangements and artifacts. Study time series using public or synthetic data first; do not connect a person directly to ordinary development boards and grounded instruments. Understand data provenance before choosing an algorithm.'],
 ['平均值为零不代表没有活动','Zero mean does not mean no activity','用任意单位的合成序列1、−1、1、−1做例子，均值为0，但均方根RMS为1。窗口长度、去偏置、滤波和单位都会影响特征，比较结果时要固定处理步骤。某个特征增大并不能单独解释为一种身体状态。','For the synthetic sequence 1, −1, 1, −1 in arbitrary units, mean is zero but RMS is one. Window length, offset removal, filtering and units affect features. Fix processing steps when comparing results; one increased feature does not uniquely identify a physiological state.'],
 ['把伪迹和数据泄漏列进实验','Include artifacts and leakage in the experiment','动作、电极接触变化和电源干扰可能比目标信号更强。若把同一受试者同一会话的重叠窗口随机拆入训练和测试，模型可能利用相似性得到虚高成绩。根据研究问题按受试者或会话划分，并说明同意与使用范围。','Motion, contact changes and power interference may exceed the signal of interest. Randomly splitting overlapping windows from one subject and session can inflate test results through similarity. Split by subject or session as the research question requires and document consent and allowed use.'],
 ['先让分类结果影响低风险界面','Begin with low-risk interface feedback','算法输出先连接屏幕指示或离线分析，记录误触发、漏触发和延迟。分类准确率不等于医疗有效性，也不等于允许驱动人体辅助机构。人体连接与助力研究还需要合规设备、专业审核和独立保护，本平台不提供这些认证。','First connect outputs to screen indicators or offline analysis and record false triggers, misses and delay. Classification accuracy does not establish medical validity or permission to drive assistive machinery. Human-connected and assistive research needs appropriate equipment, qualified review and independent protection.']
 ],
 research:[
 ['把研究问题写成能被推翻的判断','State a claim that observations could disprove','“这个滤波器更好”可以具体写成：相同输入和最大延迟限制下，方法B的RMSE小于方法A。列出自变量、因变量、控制条件和排除规则。若实验结果无论怎样都能被解释为成功，问题就还没有写清。','Replace better filter with a testable claim: under the same input and delay limit, method B has lower RMSE than method A. Define independent and dependent variables, controlled conditions and exclusion rules. A claim that any result can satisfy is not yet precise.'],
 ['重复测量要保留分散程度','Keep variability with repeated measurements','三次读数8、10、12的均值是10，样本标准差是2。只报告10会隐藏波动；同时说明单位、样本数与测量条件。重复性好也不排除整体偏高的系统误差，需要校准或独立参考检查。','Readings 8, 10 and 12 have mean 10 and sample standard deviation 2. Reporting only 10 hides variability; include units, sample count and conditions. Good repeatability can coexist with systematic bias, which needs calibration or an independent reference.'],
 ['在相同预算下比较方法','Compare methods under matched constraints','滤波器不能只比曲线平滑程度，还要比误差与延迟；控制器不能只比最终值，还要比超调、恢复时间和输出限制。先锁定数据和约束，再比较一项改变，避免把条件变化误当作方法进步。','Compare filters by error and delay, not only smoothness; compare controllers by overshoot, recovery and output limits, not only final value. Fix data and constraints before changing a method so changed conditions do not masquerade as improvement.'],
 ['让别人能重放你的结论','Make the conclusion replayable','保留原始数据、程序版本、参数、随机种子、单位、失败样本和操作步骤。把观测与解释分开：仿真展示某模型下的趋势，实测才描述实际装置。开发日志留在内部，公开数据则按同意范围脱敏并说明处理过程。','Preserve raw data, software version, parameters, seed, units, failures and procedure. Separate observation from interpretation: simulation shows behavior under a model, while measurements describe a device. Keep development logs internal and de-identify public data within its consent and usage scope.']
 ],
 'analog-guide':[
 ['连接仪表就是改变电路','Connecting a meter changes the circuit','理想电压表内阻无限大、理想电流表内阻为零，这只是便于推导的极限模型。真实电压表会吸取电流，真实电流表会产生负担压降。测量误差要比较仪表和被测电路的阻抗，而不只看屏幕位数。','An ideal voltmeter has infinite input resistance and an ideal ammeter zero series resistance. Real voltage inputs draw current and current inputs cause burden voltage. Compare meter impedance with the circuit, rather than judging measurement quality only from display digits.'],
 ['逐步计算分压器加载','Calculate divider loading step by step','10V接两个1kΩ串联，未接表时中点5V。将10kΩ电压表并在下臂，R下=1kΩ∥10kΩ≈909.1Ω；新读数10×909.1/(1000+909.1)≈4.762V，较原值低约4.76%。','Two 1 kΩ resistors across 10 V give 5 V unloaded. A 10 kΩ meter across the lower resistor makes Rlower≈909.1 Ω. The new reading is 10×909.1/(1000+909.1)≈4.762 V, about 4.76% below the original.'],
 ['量程可能改变分辨率和负担','Range can change resolution and burden','部分仪表不同量程采用不同分流电阻或输入路径。若电流路径内阻0.1Ω、通过0.5A，负担压降是0.05V，内部功耗0.025W。此压降可能改变被测支路电流；具体仪表还需核对保险丝、导线和端子。','Some meters use different shunts or input paths on different ranges. At 0.5 A through 0.1 Ω, burden is 0.05 V and internal dissipation 0.025 W. That drop can alter branch current; include the actual fuse, leads and terminals in a real assessment.'],
 ['用阻抗比预测误差方向','Predict the error direction from impedance','固定分压电阻，逐渐提高电压表内阻，读数应逐渐接近理想值；降低内阻，加载更强、读数更低。记录理想值、读数、绝对误差和相对误差。当前操作台演示电压表分压加载，电流表负担以本章算例说明。','With divider resistors fixed, increasing voltmeter input resistance should move the reading toward the ideal value. Lower input resistance increases loading and lowers the reading. Record ideal, measured, absolute error and relative error. The workbench models voltage loading; current burden is explained by the worked example.']
 ],
 'hotair-guide':[
 ['先分清三个温度','Distinguish three temperatures','设备设定温度、喷嘴出口附近温度和元件焊点温度不是同一个量。热量沿空气、元件、焊盘与板材传递，还会散失到周围。即使设定不变，不同板卡的工件温度曲线也可能不同。','Station setpoint, air temperature near the nozzle and joint temperature are different quantities. Heat travels through air, parts, pads and board while escaping to the surroundings. The same setting can produce different workpiece histories on different boards.'],
 ['用热惯性理解温度追赶','Understand temperature lag with thermal inertia','简单一阶模型把温差当作加热动力：dT/dt=(T源−T)/τ。时间常数越大，工件追赶热源越慢。它忽略了空间温差、相变、风场和许多材料细节，所以课堂曲线能比较趋势，不能推算喷嘴距离对应的真实板温。','A simple first-order model uses dT/dt=(Tsource−T)/τ. Larger time constant means slower approach to the source. It omits spatial gradients, phase change, airflow and material detail, so the classroom curve compares trends rather than predicting board temperature from nozzle distance.'],
 ['局部加热也会影响周边','Local heating affects neighboring parts','喷嘴、风量、距离、预热和屏蔽共同改变热暴露。太强气流可能移动小元件，热不均可能让一侧焊料先熔而另一侧未熔。真实返修方案应按封装、板材、焊料和设备限制制定，并监测工件温度。','Nozzle, airflow, distance, preheat and shielding alter thermal exposure. Strong air can move small parts; uneven heat can melt one side while another remains solid. A real rework process follows package, board, solder and equipment limits with workpiece-temperature measurement.'],
 ['冷却后的检查也是工序','Post-cooling inspection is part of the process','确认冷却后检查方向、偏移、桥连、焊盘损伤和周边器件，再做断电电气检查。不要靠撬动尚未完全熔融的器件确认状态，也不要只看表面锡亮不亮。本平台的热模型没有预测实际损伤阈值。','After controlled cooling, inspect orientation, alignment, bridges, pad damage and adjacent parts, then perform unpowered electrical checks. Do not pry a partly molten component or judge only by shine. The platform’s thermal model does not predict actual damage thresholds.']
 ],
 'stencil-guide':[
 ['从焊盘、开口和厚度读懂钢网','Read pad, aperture and stencil thickness','焊盘是电路板上的连接区域，钢网开口决定锡膏通过的位置，厚度参与决定理论沉积量。三者相关但不能直接画等号。封装间距、焊盘形状和工艺要求会影响开口设计。','A pad is the board connection area, an aperture controls where paste passes, and stencil thickness contributes to theoretical deposited volume. These are related but not identical. Package pitch, pad geometry and process requirements influence aperture design.'],
 ['先算一个方形开口','Calculate one square aperture','边长a、厚度t的理想方孔体积为a²t。a=0.3mm、t=0.12mm时V=0.0108mm³。把边长改0.4mm，体积变0.0192mm³，并非只增加三分之一，因为面积随边长平方变化。','An ideal square aperture has volume a²t. With a=0.3 mm and t=0.12 mm, V=0.0108 mm³. Increasing a to 0.4 mm gives 0.0192 mm³, more than a one-third increase because area scales with the square of side length.'],
 ['面积比说明开口与侧壁的关系','Area ratio compares opening with walls','方孔开口面积a²，侧壁面积4at，面积比AR=a/(4t)。0.3mm与0.12mm得到0.625。相同开口做得更厚，会增加理论体积，却降低面积比；真实脱模还依赖锡膏、壁面与分离过程，不能从单一几何值保证合格。','For a square opening, area is a² and wall area is 4at, giving AR=a/(4t). Values 0.3 mm and 0.12 mm give 0.625. More thickness increases volume but reduces area ratio. Paste, wall finish and separation also affect release, so geometry alone cannot guarantee print quality.'],
 ['从印刷缺陷追溯原因','Trace print defects to their causes','偏移、少锡、桥连和拉尖可能来自对位、锡膏状态、刮印、支撑或脱模。先检查每个沉积是否覆盖目标焊盘，再决定是否进入贴装。当前操作台计算方形几何，不测量真实锡膏体积，也不执行印刷过程仿真。','Misalignment, insufficient paste, bridges and peaks can come from alignment, paste condition, printing, support or release. Inspect deposits against intended pads before placement. The workbench calculates square-aperture geometry; it neither measures real paste nor simulates the complete printing process.']
 ],
 'reflow-guide':[
 ['读一条温度随时间变化的曲线','Read temperature over time','横轴是时间，纵轴是实际工件温度。预热控制升温，浸润帮助均衡温差与材料过程，回流提供焊料形成连接所需的热历程，冷却影响凝固。不同工艺可能采用不同曲线形状，不一定都有明显平台。','The horizontal axis is time and vertical axis actual workpiece temperature. Preheat controls heating, soak can equalize temperatures and support material processes, reflow provides the joining thermal history, and cooling governs solidification. Real processes use different shapes and may not have a distinct plateau.'],
 ['液相线上时间不等于峰值停留','Time above liquidus is not peak dwell','液相线上时间TAL从焊点温度升过所用焊料液相线开始，到冷却回落到该温度结束。峰值只是在这段热历程中达到的最高温度。材料不同液相线不同，所以相同峰值与同一时间值不能直接复制给所有焊料。','Time above liquidus runs from the joint rising above the solder’s liquidus to cooling below it. Peak is only the maximum reached during the history. Materials have different liquidus temperatures, so a peak and duration cannot be transferred universally between solders.'],
 ['用课堂窗口学习判断越界','Use a classroom window to learn comparison','本操作台假设峰值225–245°C、TAL 40–70s供练习比较。240°C与60s在此假定窗口内；240°C与20s在时间条件上不满足。这个判断只说明是否符合课堂给定条件，不是对任何产品的工艺认可。','The workbench assumes peak 225–245°C and TAL 40–70 s for comparison practice. Values 240°C and 60 s meet those assumptions; 240°C and 20 s fail the duration condition. This is a classroom criterion, not process approval for any product.'],
 ['真实工艺以测温和材料限制收尾','Validate real profiles with temperature and material limits','读取焊膏与所有关键器件限制，选择测温点并用适当热电偶记录实际板温，比较最冷与最热位置。再检查焊点与功能，并记录返修次数。加热台显示值和网页示意曲线都不能代替这份测量。','Read paste and critical-component limits, choose measurement locations and record actual board temperature with suitable thermocouples, including cold and hot regions. Inspect joints and function and record rework history. Heater displays and the webpage illustration do not replace those measurements.']
 ]
});

// Each section is authored as a matched Chinese/English pair.
Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 ac:[
 ['先把波形拆成偏置和变化','Separate offset from variation','把电压写成v(t)=V0+A·sin(2πft+φ)。V0让整条波形上下平移，A决定围绕中线摆动多大，f决定每秒重复几次，φ决定起点。先只改一个量，观察哪个特征变了。','Write v(t)=V0+A·sin(2πft+φ). V0 shifts the trace vertically, A sets the excursion about its center, f sets repetitions per second, and φ sets the starting phase. Change one quantity and identify the feature it controls.'],
 ['用时间差读懂相位','Read phase from a time difference','两条同频正弦波相差四分之一周期，对应90°。若周期1ms，一条比另一条晚0.25ms到峰值，就称其滞后90°。频率不同的波形没有一个保持不变的相位差。','For equal-frequency sine waves, one quarter of a period corresponds to 90°. At a 1 ms period, a peak delayed by 0.25 ms lags by 90°. Different-frequency signals do not keep one constant phase difference.'],
 ['有效值要从发热理解','Understand RMS through heating','对电阻，瞬时功率为v²/R，所以先平方、取时间平均、再开方，得到能产生相同平均热功率的直流电压。零偏置正弦A=2V时有效值约1.414V；若另加2V直流偏置，总有效值约2.449V。','Resistor power is v²/R, so square voltage, average over time and take the square root. This gives the DC voltage with equal average heating. A zero-offset 2 V peak sine has 1.414 V RMS; adding 2 V DC gives about 2.449 V total RMS.'],
 ['阻抗同时影响大小和时序','Impedance affects magnitude and timing','电容中i=C·dv/dt，频率提高时同样电压变化更快，电流也更大，所以容抗大小1/(2πfC)下降。电感中v=L·di/dt，感抗随频率上升。阻抗需要幅值和相位一起描述，不能只用一个固定电阻替代。','For a capacitor, i=C·dv/dt: at higher frequency the same voltage amplitude changes faster, so current increases and |ZC|=1/(2πfC) falls. For an inductor, v=L·di/dt and reactance rises with frequency. Impedance carries both magnitude and phase.']
 ],
 adc:[
 ['采样先决定何时看，量化再决定怎么记','Sampling chooses when; quantization chooses the code','ADC每隔一定时间观察输入，再用有限数字表示结果。采样率决定时间间隔，位数决定幅值码数量；提高位数不会自动加快采样，提高采样率也不会自动校准参考电压。先分别列出时间和幅值要求。','An ADC observes input at selected times and represents it with a finite code. Sample rate sets time spacing; bit depth sets the number of amplitude codes. More bits do not automatically mean faster sampling, and faster sampling does not calibrate the reference.'],
 ['从电压范围算出一格有多大','Calculate the size of one code step','理想12位单极性ADC有4096个码，通常编号0到4095。若输入跨度为3.3V，一个LSB约0.806mV。用4095还是4096做具体换算，要看数据手册的端点和码区间约定；不要把显示小数位当作新增精度。','An ideal 12-bit unipolar ADC has 4096 codes, normally numbered 0 through 4095. Over a 3.3 V span, one LSB is about 0.806 mV. Exact endpoint conversion follows the datasheet transfer convention; extra displayed decimals do not create accuracy.'],
 ['为什么高频会伪装成低频','How a high frequency appears as a low one','每秒取10000点时，8kHz正弦可能在样本中表现为2kHz。两个不同连续信号能经过同一组采样点，软件便无法唯一恢复原来是哪一个。ADC前的抗混叠滤波和足够采样率要一起设计，且实际滤波器需要过渡带。','At 10000 samples/s, an 8 kHz sine can appear as 2 kHz. Different continuous signals may pass through the same samples, so software cannot uniquely identify the original. Design analog anti-alias filtering and sample rate together, allowing a real filter transition band.'],
 ['转换前还要等输入稳定','Allow the input to settle','许多ADC内部有采样电容，信号源必须在采样窗口内为它充电。源阻抗过大、通道切换太快或采样时间太短，都会让结果偏离输入。实际排查按参考电压、输入范围、建立时间、噪声、时间戳逐项进行。','Many ADCs contain a sampling capacitor that must charge during the acquisition window. High source impedance, rapid channel switching or a short acquisition time can create error. Check reference voltage, allowed input range, settling time, noise and timestamps separately.']
 ],
 opamp:[
 ['先认识两个输入和一个输出','Meet two inputs and one output','运放放大同相端与反相端的电压差。开环增益很大，所以很小的差值也可能把输出推向电源边界。负反馈把一部分输出送回反相端，才让电路在允许范围内形成可计算的闭环关系。','An op-amp amplifies the difference between its non-inverting and inverting inputs. Large open-loop gain means a small difference can drive the output to a supply limit. Negative feedback returns part of the output and can establish a useful closed-loop relation within operating limits.'],
 ['虚短是一项条件近似','The virtual short is a conditional approximation','在稳定负反馈、输出未饱和且动态足够慢时，可近似认为两个输入电压相等。它们并未被导线短接，输入电流也只是近似很小。若输出已经顶到供电上限，这个近似通常不能继续拿来求解。','With stable negative feedback, an unsaturated output and sufficiently slow dynamics, the input voltages are approximately equal. They are not physically shorted, and input current is only approximately small. Once the output hits a limit, the approximation generally fails.'],
 ['一步算增益，再查能否输出','Calculate gain, then check headroom','同相放大器的Rf从输出接反相端，Rg从反相端接参考地，理想增益1+Rf/Rg。Rf=90kΩ、Rg=10kΩ时增益10，0.2V输入希望输出2V。接着核对输入共模范围、供电、输出摆幅和负载，而不是停在乘法结果。','For a non-inverting stage, Rf connects output to the inverting node and Rg connects that node to reference. Ideal gain is 1+Rf/Rg. With 90 kΩ and 10 kΩ, a 0.2 V input requests 2 V output. Then check common-mode range, supplies, output swing and load.'],
 ['比较器的任务是作出判定','A comparator makes a decision','比较器回答输入在阈值上方还是下方。给上升与下降设置不同门限就是滞回，能减少阈值附近噪声引起的反复切换。运放的线性工作、比较器的快速翻转和开漏输出上拉，是不同问题，选型前要分清。','A comparator decides whether input is above or below a threshold. Hysteresis uses different rising and falling thresholds to reduce repeated switching near a noisy boundary. Linear op-amp operation, comparator switching and an open-drain pull-up are distinct design concerns.']
 ],
 protection:[
 ['把电源做成一份能量预算','Make a power budget','先写输入电压范围，再列每条电源轨的持续电流和峰值电流。LDO从12V降到3.3V、带0.2A时，约1.74W变成热；不能因负载只需要0.66W就忽略稳压器发热。开关电源也要检查效率、纹波和负载瞬态。','List input voltage range, then continuous and peak current on each rail. An LDO dropping 12 V to 3.3 V at 0.2 A dissipates about 1.74 W, even though the load consumes only 0.66 W. A switching supply also needs efficiency, ripple and transient checks.'],
 ['沿回流路径追踪电流','Trace the return current','电流要回到源头，地符号只是网络标记。大电机电流经过一段有电阻和电感的导线时会产生压降，敏感传感器若把这段路径当参考，就可能一起读到扰动。画出完整供电与回流路径，再讨论单点地或地平面。','Current returns to its source; a ground symbol is a net label. Motor current creates voltage across real wire resistance and inductance. A sensor sharing that return may see the disturbance as part of its reference. Draw complete supply and return paths before choosing a grounding scheme.'],
 ['去耦为什么要靠近引脚','Why decoupling sits near the pin','理想电容短时供电可用ΔV≈IΔt/C估算：10mA持续10μs、允许掉0.1V，理论上需要1μF。真实设计还受ESR、ESL、偏压降容与回路面积影响。这是起点估算，不是给所有芯片统一贴一颗电容的规则。','For an ideal capacitor, ΔV≈IΔt/C. Supplying 10 mA for 10 μs while allowing 0.1 V droop requires 1 μF in that estimate. ESR, ESL, DC-bias effects and loop geometry matter in reality. The estimate is a starting point, not a universal capacitor choice.'],
 ['每一种保护都对应一种故障','Match protection to a fault','保险丝主要限制故障持续能量，反接保护应对接反，TVS针对规定脉冲范围的过压，限流负责限制输出电流。它们有动作时间、额定值和失效模式。先定义故障，再检查器件是否能承受并可靠动作，不能只堆叠名称。','A fuse limits sustained fault energy, reverse-polarity protection addresses reversed input, a TVS handles specified transients, and current limiting constrains output. Each has response time, ratings and failure modes. Define the fault, then verify that the selected protection can withstand and interrupt it.']
 ],
 solder:[
 ['先区分熔化和润湿','Distinguish melting from wetting','焊料熔化并不意味着形成了好连接。焊盘与引脚表面要清洁，助焊剂要发挥作用，热量要同时传到待连接的金属。观察焊料能否沿表面铺展并形成连续过渡，比单看烙铁温度更有意义。','Molten solder does not by itself make a sound connection. Pads and leads need suitable surfaces, active flux and heat delivered to both metals. Observe whether solder wets and forms a continuous transition instead of judging the joint only from the station setpoint.'],
 ['用热路径解释为什么焊不上','Explain poor heating with the heat path','大地平面会把热量带走，过小烙铁头可能接触面积不足。应在工艺允许范围内选择合适焊头和接触方式；一味加温可能先损伤塑料和焊盘。课堂温度曲线只表示工件逐渐接近热源的趋势。','A large ground plane removes heat, while a tiny tip may provide too little contact area. Use an appropriate tip and contact method within process limits; simply increasing temperature can damage pads or plastic. The classroom curve only illustrates a workpiece approaching its heat source.'],
 ['按连接过程组织动作','Organize the joining sequence','从断电与固定工件开始，确认通风和防烫措施，检查焊盘、焊头与材料。按材料工艺加热接合部位并供给合适焊料，移开热源后让连接静止冷却。避免靠外力拉扯尚未冷却的焊点。','Begin with power removed and the work secured, with ventilation and burn protection in place. Inspect pad, tip and materials. Heat the joint and feed suitable solder according to the material process, then let the connection cool without movement after removing heat.'],
 ['把外观检查和电气检查结合','Combine visual and electrical inspection','检查桥连、偏移、未润湿、少锡和焊盘损伤，再在断电状态检查需要连通和不应短接的节点。某些无铅焊点外观较暗，光亮程度不能单独决定好坏。连续性合格也不证明机械强度、长期可靠性或无隐藏缺陷。','Inspect bridges, misalignment, non-wetting, insufficient solder and pad damage, then test intended continuity and unintended shorts while unpowered. Some lead-free joints look dull, so shininess alone is not a quality test. Continuity does not establish mechanical strength or long-term reliability.']
 ],
 protocol:[
 ['先画四层接口表','Write a four-layer interface table','每条连线先记录连接器针脚、电压与驱动方式、位时序、消息含义。UART外设可以经过RS-232或RS-485收发器连接不同电气链路；TX/RX信号名并不允许把这些电平直接互连。先把层次写清，排错才有顺序。','For each link record connector pins, electrical levels and drivers, bit timing, and message meaning. A UART may connect through an RS-232 or RS-485 transceiver. Labels such as TX and RX do not make those electrical interfaces directly compatible.'],
 ['UART用约定的时钟读一帧','UART reads a frame using agreed timing','8N1表示8个数据位、无校验、1个停止位，再加1个起始位，共10位。9600baud下单帧约10/9600=1.042ms，连续发送的理论上限约960字节每秒，尚未包含应用等待与额外协议开销。','8N1 means eight data bits, no parity and one stop bit. Adding the start bit gives ten bits per frame. At 9600 baud, a frame takes about 1.042 ms and the continuous theoretical limit is 960 bytes/s before application delays or further protocol overhead.'],
 ['I²C要知道谁在拉低总线','Know who drives an I²C acknowledgment','在常见双向I²C中，发送方在应答位释放SDA，接收方在第九个时钟拉低SDA表示ACK。地址常以7位数表示，在线传输时还会带R/W位；把已经移位的8位值再移位会找错设备。NACK也可能表示接收方结束读取，不能一概称为坏线。','In ordinary bidirectional I²C, the transmitter releases SDA for acknowledgment and the receiver pulls it low on the ninth clock for ACK. A seven-bit address is combined with a direction bit on the wire. Do not shift an already shifted address again. NACK can also intentionally end a read.'],
 ['SPI和CAN各自解决不同问题','SPI and CAN solve different problems','SPI依靠片选和时钟边沿约定交换位，CPOL/CPHA、位序、帧长与片选间隙都要核对。CAN通过仲裁标识符组织消息，并有应答与错误处理；标识符主要表示消息优先级和含义，不必等同设备地址。控制器与收发器的职责也不同。','SPI exchanges bits under chip-select and clock-edge rules; check mode, bit order, frame length and chip-select timing. CAN uses arbitration identifiers plus acknowledgment and error handling. An identifier usually expresses message priority and meaning, not necessarily a device address. Controller and transceiver have different roles.']
 ]
});

Object.assign(DEEP_LESSONS,{
 vision:[
 ['把图像当作一张有坐标的表','Treat an image as a table with coordinates','灰度图可看成高度H、宽度W的数组，每个位置存一个强度值。常见8位图使用0到255，但传感器原始图像和浮点图像范围可能不同。先确定数组形状、通道顺序和数据类型，再读某个像素。','A grayscale image is an H-by-W array of intensity values. Eight-bit images commonly use 0 through 255, while raw sensor and floating-point images may use other ranges. Identify shape, channel order and data type before interpreting a pixel.'],
 ['阈值是一条明确规则','A threshold is an explicit rule','本例使用gray>threshold作为前景条件。像素40、120、200在阈值100下得到0、1、1；阈值150时变成0、0、1。阈值等于像素值时，该像素在本例归到背景。把规则写清才能复现边界行为。','This model defines foreground by gray>threshold. Values 40, 120 and 200 become 0, 1 and 1 at threshold 100, then 0, 0 and 1 at threshold 150. A value equal to the threshold is background here. State the comparison rule to reproduce boundary cases.'],
 ['直方图解释有多少像素会改变','A histogram explains how many pixels change','直方图横轴是灰度值，纵轴是该灰度的像素数，不表示这些像素在图中的位置。把阈值移过一个高峰，会让大量像素同时改变类别。两张布局完全不同的图可以有同样直方图，所以它不能单独识别物体形状。','A histogram plots intensity against pixel count, not pixel location. Moving a threshold across a large peak changes many labels at once. Images with different layouts can have identical histograms, so a histogram alone cannot identify shape.'],
 ['用失败场景检验分割','Evaluate segmentation with failure cases','先在当前合成图像中预测前景比例，再换一组阈值比较。真实任务还要采集阴影、反光、背景和姿态变化；固定阈值不适用时可研究局部阈值和受控照明。记录漏检与误检，不能把一张干净掩膜当作识别成功率。','First predict foreground fraction in the synthetic image, then compare thresholds. Real tasks need shadows, glare, background and pose variation. Local thresholds and controlled lighting may help when a fixed threshold fails. Measure misses and false positives instead of treating one clean mask as recognition accuracy.']
 ],
 project:[
 ['把愿望改成可测的需求','Turn a wish into a measurable requirement','“小车运行稳定”需要拆成速度、载荷、路面、停车距离和允许失联时间等条件。给每项写测量方法与通过标准，再选择器件。若条件未定义，后面就无法判断升级到底改善了什么。','A wish such as stable rover motion needs conditions: speed, payload, surface, stopping distance and allowed command age. Define a measurement and acceptance criterion for each before choosing hardware. Without conditions, an upgrade has no clear basis for comparison.'],
 ['为模块画出输入输出边界','Define each module boundary','将系统分为供电、计算、传感、执行与通信。每个接口记录电压、单位、方向、更新率、连接方式和故障时的输出。编码器发来的是计数还是rad/s、控制器输出的是占空比还是目标转矩，都必须明确。','Split the system into power, computation, sensing, actuation and communication. For every interface record voltage, units, direction, update rate, connection and failure output. Encoder counts and rad/s are different data; duty cycle and torque commands are different interfaces.'],
 ['一次只闭合一个反馈环','Close one feedback loop at a time','先验证电源，再记录一个传感器，再低能量驱动一个执行器，然后让反馈参与控制。每一步保留可独立运行的最小例子。若一次加入所有模块，出现振荡时就难以区分符号、时延、测量与控制参数的问题。','Verify power, record one sensor, drive one actuator at low energy, then introduce feedback. Keep a standalone minimal example for each stage. Integrating everything at once makes oscillation difficult to trace to sign, delay, measurement or tuning.'],
 ['验收要包含失败与恢复','Acceptance includes failure and recovery','在相同条件下重复正常任务，并有计划地测试输入缺失、消息超时和传感器异常。记录触发条件、系统反应、恢复条件与原始数据。网页里完成路线表示学习记录，真实项目性能必须由自己的测量和测试计划支持。','Repeat normal tasks under controlled conditions and deliberately test missing input, stale messages and sensor faults. Record trigger, response, recovery condition and raw data. Completing this learning path records study; real project performance needs its own measurements and acceptance plan.']
 ],
 'c-memory':[
 ['从一个变量的存储开始','Start with one stored object','声明一个变量同时确定类型、大小要求、取值范围和生命周期。地址回答对象存在哪里，值回答里面是什么。指针保存地址；读取指针指向的内容前，要确保它指向仍然存在、类型与对齐合适的对象。','A variable declaration establishes type, storage requirements, value range and lifetime. Its address says where it is; its value says what it holds. A pointer stores an address. Dereference only when it refers to a live object with suitable type and alignment.'],
 ['数组长度必须随着接口传递','Carry array length through the interface','长度为4的数组有效下标是0、1、2、3。指向尾后位置的指针可用于比较和结束循环，但不能解引用。数组传到普通指针参数后，函数不能只靠这个指针知道原长度，必须另传长度或采用能携带边界的接口。','An array of length four has valid indices 0, 1, 2 and 3. A one-past-end pointer may serve as a comparison boundary but must not be dereferenced. A function receiving an ordinary pointer does not automatically know the original array length; pass it explicitly.'],
 ['位掩码先明确宽度与符号','Choose width and sign before bit operations','0xA5等于二进制10100101，与0x0F按位与得到00000101，即5。设置第3位可按位或1u<<3，清除则与它的按位反。真实寄存器可能写1清零，不能机械套用读改写；先查该位的访问语义。','0xA5 is 10100101; AND with 0x0F gives 00000101, or 5. OR with 1u<<3 sets bit 3; AND with its complement clears it. A hardware register may use write-one-to-clear semantics, so ordinary read-modify-write is not always safe.'],
 ['生命周期错误和并发错误分别排查','Separate lifetime from concurrency errors','返回局部自动变量的地址不会延长它的生命周期，释放后继续用指针也不会因数值看似没变而合法。volatile常用于要求实际外设访问，但不提供原子性或任务间同步；共享数据仍需要合适的同步机制。','Returning a local automatic object address does not extend its lifetime, and a freed pointer is not valid because the old value still appears present. Volatile is often used for actual peripheral accesses, but it does not provide atomicity or inter-task synchronization.']
 ],
 boards:[
 ['先写任务，再选平台','Choose the task before the platform','把任务拆成采样频率、控制期限、接口、缓存大小、网络和图像需求。精确定时输出往往适合MCU外设；文件系统和复杂网络适合操作系统；加速器则要看能运行哪些模型算子。平台类别只是起点，最终要核对具体型号。','List sample rate, control deadline, interfaces, buffering, networking and imaging needs. MCU peripherals often suit precise timing, an operating system helps with files and complex networking, and acceleration depends on supported operators. Verify the exact product, not only its category.'],
 ['用图像大小算一笔内存账','Calculate an image memory budget','320×240的RGB565图像每像素2字节，一帧需要153600字节，约150KiB；双缓冲仅像素数据就需约300KiB。程序、堆栈、模型权重和中间张量还要另算，不能把全部标称内存都当作图像空间。','A 320×240 RGB565 frame uses two bytes per pixel: 153600 bytes, about 150 KiB. Double buffering requires about 300 KiB for pixels alone. Code, stacks, model weights and intermediate tensors need additional memory.'],
 ['核对电气条件与软件支持','Check electrical and software fit','记录供电入口与GPIO电平，两者可能分别为5V和3.3V。再核对操作系统镜像、SDK、驱动、板卡核心和库版本。芯片支持某外设并不保证开发板把对应引脚引出，也不保证当前软件已经提供可用驱动。','Supply input and GPIO levels may be 5 V and 3.3 V respectively. Then check OS image, SDK, drivers, board core and library versions. A chip peripheral may not be routed to a board connector or supported by the chosen software release.'],
 ['用最小任务衡量真实能力','Measure capability with a minimal task','先完成一个可重现小任务：固定分辨率采集、固定预处理、运行一次算法，再记录端到端延迟、峰值内存、功耗和温度。仅比较CPU频率或宣传算力，无法确定整个系统的吞吐量和控制稳定性。','Run a reproducible small task with fixed capture resolution, preprocessing and algorithm, then measure end-to-end latency, peak memory, power and temperature. CPU clock or advertised compute alone cannot determine system throughput or control stability.']
 ],
 sensors:[
 ['先辨认实际测量的物理量','Identify the quantity actually measured','加速度计测比力，陀螺测角速度，编码器测角度或计数，测距器测某一方向的距离。姿态、位置和物体类别通常需要进一步模型或处理。记录轴方向与单位后，才能把不同传感器放进同一个计算。','An accelerometer measures specific force, a gyro angular rate, an encoder angle or counts, and a range sensor distance in a defined direction. Attitude, position and object class usually need further modeling. Record axes and units before combining measurements.'],
 ['用两个已知点建立换算','Calibrate with known reference points','假定物理量0对应原始读数100，物理量10对应1100，线性换算为y=(raw−100)×0.01。读数600应得到5。再用中间和边界点验证线性假设，并记录温度与方向；两点拟合不会自动消除非线性和迟滞。','Suppose physical value 0 gives raw 100, and value 10 gives raw 1100. A linear conversion is y=(raw−100)×0.01, so raw 600 gives 5. Validate intermediate and boundary points and record temperature and orientation; two-point calibration does not remove nonlinearity or hysteresis.'],
 ['平滑要付出时间代价','Smoothing has a timing cost','100Hz采样时每点间隔10ms。因果5点移动平均在通带内引入约2个采样间隔、即20ms群延迟。一阶数字低通可写y[k]=y[k−1]+α(x[k]−y[k−1])；减小α通常更平滑，也更慢。比较滤波器要同时看噪声和延迟。','At 100 Hz, samples are 10 ms apart. A causal five-point moving average has a two-sample, 20 ms group delay in its passband. A first-order digital low-pass can use y[k]=y[k−1]+α(x[k]−y[k−1]); smaller α is usually smoother but slower. Evaluate noise and delay together.'],
 ['别让坏数据悄悄进入控制','Keep invalid data visible','每条测量保留时间戳、有效标志和合理范围。检测超时、跳变、饱和与通信失败，并定义控制器采用旧值、降级还是停机。滤波可以压低噪声，却不能把断线数据变成可信测量，也不能补回采样前已丢失的信息。','Keep timestamp, validity and plausible range with each measurement. Detect stale data, jumps, saturation and link failures, then define whether control holds, degrades or stops. Filtering can reduce noise but cannot turn a broken connection into a trustworthy measurement.']
 ],
 rtos:[
 ['任务是有时间要求的工作','A task is work with timing requirements','给每个任务写周期、最坏执行时间和截止期限。例如控制任务每1ms运行一次、最多用0.2ms，日志任务每10ms运行一次、最多0.5ms，理想CPU利用率为25%。这个比例尚未包含中断、阻塞和调度开销，也不能单独证明所有期限都能满足。','Record period, worst-case execution time and deadline. A control task taking 0.2 ms every 1 ms and logging taking 0.5 ms every 10 ms use 25% nominal CPU time. Interrupts, blocking and scheduling overhead are additional; utilization alone does not prove deadline compliance.'],
 ['让数据通过有边界的通道流动','Move data through bounded channels','采样任务把带时间戳的测量送入队列，控制任务取出处理。队列容量有限，要定义满时丢旧、丢新、等待还是报警。采样200次每秒、消费100次每秒时，增加队列只能延后溢出，不能解决长期吞吐差。','A sampling task sends timestamped data through a queue to a control task. Define what a full queue does: drop oldest, drop newest, wait or report. If production is 200 samples/s and consumption 100 samples/s, a larger queue only postpones overflow.'],
 ['锁保护共享资源，通知表示事件','Use ownership and event signals deliberately','互斥锁表达某个任务暂时拥有共享资源；信号量常用于通知事件或计数资源。持锁时间越长，其他任务等待越久。多个锁采用固定获取顺序，避免在锁内执行不受控的文件或网络I/O，并定义超时处理。','A mutex expresses temporary ownership of a shared resource; a semaphore often signals an event or counts resources. Longer ownership means longer waits. Acquire multiple locks in a fixed order, avoid uncontrolled file or network I/O while holding them, and define timeout behavior.'],
 ['从测量看调度是否正确','Measure scheduling behavior','记录任务启动时间、执行时间、队列长度和栈余量，并用相同负载重复测试。中断中只做必要工作，调用中断允许的接口后把较长处理交给任务。本平台CPU单步能帮助理解执行顺序，但不会模拟真实RTOS调度器。','Record start times, execution durations, queue lengths and stack margins under repeated loads. Keep interrupts short, use APIs allowed from interrupts and defer longer work to tasks. This platform CPU stepper illustrates execution order; it does not simulate a real RTOS scheduler.']
 ]
});
